.com/users/jrumandal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jrumandal","id":23195374,"login":"jrumandal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTk1Mzc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commits/8912a6068832cbb810d2ef932a0a0643387c5bdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T22:58:42Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T22:58:42Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"message":"feat(orchestrator): add mf-orchestrator repo (B.4)\n\nCross-repo CI/CD coordination meta-repo:\n- repos.json: registry of 11 repos (type, publish, dependsOn, packages)\n- repos.schema.json: JSON Schema for the registry\n- scripts/topo-sort.mjs: Kahn''s algorithm release order (deps first)\n- scripts/bump-version.mjs: bump a repo''s package.json version (tolerant of missing repos)\n- scripts/orchestrate.mjs: bump-all in topo order + publish fan-out plan\n- scripts/trigger-release.mjs: fan-out dispatch via GitHub REST API (waits per repo, aborts on failure)\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: ci-only (validate graph + scripts)\n- .github/workflows/release.yml: manual workflow_dispatch fan-out\n- README.md, .gitignore, .nvmrc, .npmrc, package.json\n\nValidated: topo order, dry-run orchestrate (local + CI scenarios), syntax checks.\nSTEPS.md B.4 marked done.","tr