mandal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commits/a67805fc35f65910667cdfa1212d3822fb2a708f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T22:37:29Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T22:37:29Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"message":"feat(backend): add 5 backend repos (server-shared, gateway, catalog-svc, cart-svc, user-svc)\n\nPhase B.1 + B.2 — split the monolithic backend into 5 self-contained repos:\n- server-shared (@server/shared): Prisma, config, health, logging, error filter\n- gateway (@server/api-gateway): stitched GraphQL gateway (@graphql-tools/stitch + @apollo/server)\n- catalog-svc / cart-svc / user-svc: NestJS GraphQL micro-services + Prisma\n\nEach repo is self-contained (own package.json, CI/CD, README, tsconfig, eslint,\njest). Services + gateway depend on @server/shared via workspace:*. All 5\nvalidated: pnpm install + lint + typecheck + test + build pass.\n\n- gateway + services: ci-only (private deployable services, no publish)\n- server-shared: ci + publish (npm library)\n- CI checks out server-shared as sibling, builds it (prisma generate + tsc),\n  then validates the dependent repo.\n- Updated STEPS.md Phase B (B.1/B.2 done) + pnpm-workspace.yaml (5 backend repos)","tree":{"sha":"77564353857906db4c4af8d24c293b4f28ba1c44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/trees/77564353857906db4c4af8d24c293b4f28ba1c44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/commits/a67805fc35f65910667cdfa1212d3822fb2a708f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23195374?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":