andal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T18:58:43Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"message":"fix: Phase 6.4 — gateway bootstrap + shell SSR bridge/vue resolution\n\nGateway (api-gateway):\n- main.ts: build stitched schema eagerly via onModuleInit() BEFORE\n  Swagger/router setup (NestFactory.create does not await OnModuleInit);\n  register /graphql Express middleware before app.listen() so the NestJS\n  router 404 handler does not swallow POST /graphql\n- gateway.service.ts: make onModuleInit() idempotent (early-exit if\n  schema already built)\n\nShell SSR (apps/shell):\n- project.json: externalDependencies [\"@shared/bridge\", \"vue\",\n  \"@vue/server-renderer\"] so Vite SSR module runner loads them via\n  Node native resolution instead of pre-bundling (esbuild dep-optimizer\n  cannot resolve source-only TS workspace packages)\n- package.json: add @shared/bridge workspace dep\n- mf-ssr.server.ts + mf-client-bootstrap.ts: direct import of\n  @shared/bridge + getSharedBridgeAdapter() helper\n\nBridge (libs/shared/bridge):\n- package.json: main → ../../../dist/libs/shared/bridge/src/index.js\n  (real compiled file; fresh clones need ''nx build bridge'' first)\n\nRoot:\n- package.json: add @angular/router 20.3.29 + @shared/bridge workspace:*\n- tsconfig.base.json: add @shared/bridge paths entry; remove duplicate\n  @server/shared key\n- pnpm-lock.yaml: updated\n\nVerified: gateway /health all 3 up; cross-domain GraphQL query returns\n4 products / 3 categories / me; shell SSR 302→200 with real HTML\n(/ → <catalog-mf>, /cart → <cart-mf>, /account → <user-mf>)","tree":{"sha":"13a323f46389b0e7145d260c7a74382f5624a3df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/trees/13a323f46389b0e7145d260c7a74382f5624a3df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/commits/e57076365d2be473c4013c3642001d9250bd7716","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","si