iptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commits/75d857fc771fa45c6dff2903fe4562387dd748d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:14:00Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:14:00Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"message":"feat(dx): Phase 6.2 — aggregate Nx targets + repo-wide typecheck\n\nAdds one-command DX targets to the root project.json:\n\n- serve:all — scripts/serve-all.mjs orchestrates the full dev stack:\n  best-effort Postgres (Docker, incl. Windows-host docker.exe discovery\n  from WSL), then catalog/cart/user services in parallel, waits for\n  ports 4001/4002/4003, then api-gateway (4200) + shell (4300).\n  Streams prefixed output; SIGINT/SIGTERM teardown with SIGKILL fallback.\n- build:all / test:all / lint:all — nx run-many across all projects.\n- typecheck — scripts/typecheck.mjs runs tsc --noEmit over all 17\n  projects (concurrency 4) with a PASS/FAIL summary.\n- db:migrate / db:seed / db:studio — Prisma shortcuts.\n\nTypecheck fixes surfaced by the new aggregate target:\n- libs/mf/cart: relax noPropertyAccessFromIndexSignature (React 19\n  types use index signatures).\n- api-gateway-e2e: type the GraphQL result before assertions.\n- catalog-svc-e2e: cast globalThis for teardown message; ES2022 module.\n- contracts: keyof without typeof; ES2022 module + bundler resolution.\n\nVerified: typecheck 17/17 PASS.","tree":{"sha":"de49dfdf3ca397775063505c1928e834816f2f25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/trees/de49dfdf3ca397775063505c1928e834816f2f25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/commits/75d857fc771fa45c6dff2903fe4562387dd748d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"htt