ode_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTk1Mzc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commits/0af0bbc2d1bcafa0cacd1e3bdaf7e9df497bd4b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:13:42Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:13:42Z","email":"jrumandal@gmail.com","name":"John Ralph Umandal"},"message":"fix(server): make GraphQL resolvers + global middleware runtime-safe\n\nThe three NestJS GraphQL services (catalog-svc, cart-svc, user-svc)\ncrashed on every GraphQL request. A chain of masking bugs was found and\nfixed:\n\n- Resolvers (UserResolver, CatalogResolver, CartResolver) were missing\n  @Injectable(), so NestJS never emitted constructor design:paramtypes\n  metadata and injected PrismaService as undefined. Added the decorator\n  + import to all three.\n- LoggingInterceptor read request.method/request.url without null-safety;\n  in the Apollo context getRequest() returns undefined. Guarded with\n  optional chaining.\n- AllExceptionsFilter called response.status()/json() which are absent on\n  the GraphQL response object. Guarded before use; the error is still\n  logged and the GraphQL layer surfaces its own envelope.\n- user-svc app.module registers the DateTime scalar as a DI provider so\n  the standard GraphQLModule.forRoot flow discovers it.\n- Added @as-integrations/express5 to the three services (Express 5 +\n  Apollo requirement).\n\nVerified: all three services boot and return real data (me/orders,\nproducts/categories, cart).","tree":{"sha":"c96e655a28685ecf287478a4e9ced4136e6820d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/trees/c96e655a28685ecf287478a4e9ced4136e6820d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/commits/0af0bbc2d1bcafa0cacd1e3bdaf7e9df497bd4b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23195374?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jrumandal","id":23195374,"login":"jrumandal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTk1Mzc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commit/0af0bbc2d1bcafa0cacd1e3bdaf7e9df497bd4b7","node_id":"C_kwDOUITj6doAKDBhZjBiYmMyZDFiY2FmYTBjYWNkMWUzYmRhZjdlOWRmNDk3YmQ0Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commit/ad52a5448a69b6a729e7bce16c9a1178b7b86ea1","sha":"ad52a5448a69b6a729e7bce16c9a1178b7b86ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commits/ad52a5448a69b6a729e7bce16c9a1178b7b86ea1"}],"sha":"0af0bbc2d1bcafa0cacd1e3bdaf7e9df497bd4b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/commits/0af0bbc2d1bcafa0cacd1e3bdaf7e9df497bd4b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"