ular/ssr Express adapter)\n- 3.2 routes /catalog /cart /account, top nav + theme toggle\n- 3.3 SSR composition: server renders each MF, injects markup; client hydrates\n  (SSRF host-allowlist fixed via AngularNodeAppEngine ctor allowedHosts)\n- 3.4 shared ApolloClient: @shared/contracts owns MfApolloClient type +\n  createSharedApolloClient factory; shell creates singleton and injects via\n  each MF hydrate(); all 3 MFs accept + store apolloClient (type-only)\n- 3.5 verified: SSR HTML for all 3 MFs on :4100\n- 3.7 apps/shell/README.md (SSR composition, routes, Apollo bootstrap, run/verify)\n\nPhases 0-2 already committed; this closes Phase 3.","tree":{"sha":"c9d84f46f807ee3d44b322ddf3163d6494a7a75f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/trees/c9d84f46f807ee3d44b322ddf3163d6494a7a75f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/commits/8322441c2a48bc7338ec14d46b0726bf52cb1455","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23195374?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jrumandal","id":23195374,"login":"jrumandal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTk1Mzc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrumandal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_