cart.yaml, openapi/user.yaml\n- Full DTOs (Product/Category/Money, Cart/CartItem/ProductRef, User/Order/\n  Address/OrderStatus), Error model, operationIds, servers per service.\n\nPhase 1.2 — GraphQL SDL (done):\n- graphql/catalog.graphql, cart.graphql, user.graphql (per-service)\n- graphql/gateway.graphql (federated composition, the codegen target)\n\nPhase 1.3/1.4 — contracts lib (partial):\n- libs/shared/contracts: OpenAPI-generated TS types (openapi-typescript)\n  into src/generated/{catalog,cart,user}.ts + src/api.ts type facade +\n  src/lib/contracts.spec.ts (4 passing tests, incl. structural DTO checks).\n- scripts/generate-contracts.mjs regenerates the types from openapi/.\n- package.json: +openapi-typescript, @redocly/openapi-core,\n  @graphql-codegen/cli + typescript(+operations), graphql, jest/ts-jest.\n- nx.json: @nx/eslint + @nx/jest plugins, production inputs, tsc targetDefaults.\n- tsconfig.base.json: +@shared/contracts path alias.\n- MISSING (next): generate:graphql target + @apollo/client (1.3),\n  generate:api target + openapi-fetch (1.4), event-bus (1.5), design-tokens (1.6).\n\nHousekeeping:\n- .gitignore: +nul (Windows redirect artifact), link fix.\n- .vscode/extensions.json: +vscode-jest-runner recommendation.\n- .verdaccio/config.yml: Nx local-registry target config (legit, committed).\n- STEPS.md: tracker updated to verified Phase 1 state + lint blocker note.\n\nVerified: nx test contracts = 4/4 pass; nx build contracts = OK.\nBLOCKED: nx lint (workspace-wide, root eslint.config.mjs has no TS parser).","tree":{"sha":"424c1fda64bbde29afe64e521bbe20bc9c94e34a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/trees/424c1fda64bbde29afe64e521bbe20bc9c94e34a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrumandal/ai-gen-poc/git/commits/0e1129be9501c734f68ec3374bab8a77d52d7cc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co