received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/37a0652eb41f70843a3fd3e1a159eadfddcc5977/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:25:30Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:25:30Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"message":"fix(coding-agent): recall 挂入产品工具顺序合同（modelOrder 950）\n\n补 #12 的一致性缺口：CODING_AGENT_MODEL_TOOL_ORDER 是工具面的产品顺\n序合同（专门工具均挂 order），recall 此前未挂会落到列表尾部。现归搜索\n族尾部（directoryTree 900 与 docToPdf 1000 之间取 950，小间隔在表内\ngetGoal 系已有先例）——语义上 recall 即「会话历史的搜索工具」。","tree":{"sha":"d77db5f070fca3b2b7faf5008b8900f5a1fba3d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/d77db5f070fca3b2b7faf5008b8900f5a1fba3d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/37a0652eb41f70843a3fd3e1a159eadfddcc5977","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/37a0652eb41f70843a3fd3e1a159eadfddcc5977","node_id":"C_kwDOUIkr1toAKDM3YTA2NTJlYjQxZjcwODQzYTNmZDNlMWExNTllYWRmZGRjYzU5Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152","sha":"240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152"}],"sha":"37a0652eb41f70843a3fd3e1a159eadfddcc5977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/37a0652eb41f70843a3fd3e1a159eadfddcc5977"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:18:37Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:18:37Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"message":"feat(coding-agent): recall 工具——把被压缩的历史读回给模型\n\n会话文档在压缩后完整保留原始条目（conversation-compaction-projection\n的既有语义），但模型可见视图只剩「摘要 + 保留尾」：摘要没写到的细节对\n模型即失明，压缩成了单向门。缺的不是数据，是一条读回通路。\n\n新增 features/recall：\n\n- recall 工具（词法搜索）：query 分词 AND 匹配（全部词命中才入选），\n  大小写不敏感、CJK 按字面；按命中词数×频次排序；offset/limit 分页，\n  每条结果带 entryId 与角色；超长截断；空结果返回「该试什么」的行动\n  指引。工具描述把 AND 与字面匹配契约写明（对齐 PI-Desktop ADR 0300\n  的 recall 语义，该项目已实测词法通道覆盖主要查询、语义召回被刻意\n  冻结）。\n- 数据源闭包注入：工具执行上下文的 messages 是模型可见视图（不含被\n  压缩原文），不能作搜索底；readEntries(sessionId) 由宿主提供——\n  sessionOptions.recallReader（可选）：注入则注册工具，不注入则模型\n  界面零变化（不出现指向不存在能力的入口）。装配链走既有 session 级\n  注入先例（knowledgePageWriter 同款）：peripheral-assembly →\n  specialized-tools → registration（全场景、memory 域）。\n\nRECALL_POINTER（摘要旁告知通路）与机械账本（details.ledger）留待\n桌面端接线 PR 一并落地：提示句只有在工具真实注册的宿主里才不是谎言。\n\n测试 9 例：AND 排他性、中英混排、排序稳定性、分页 footer、空结果指\n引、async 注入、描述契约。红绿验证：把 AND 改 OR 语义实测 3 例变红。\ncoding-agent 全包通过，tsc 通过。","tree":{"sha":"dbfd6a8f170040ae439aaea15de38dba3d2e4963","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/dbfd6a8f170040ae439aaea15de38dba3d2e4963"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152","node_id":"C_kwDOUIkr1toAKDI0MGU2M2QxMTI2NTExOGY3NGRkN2ExYTc1MzUzMTY2OGY5YmMxNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","sha":"5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67"}],"sha":"240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/240e63d11265118f74dd7a1a753531668f9bc152"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/b9d56269695af19d8aabf030c40927a0aeec41b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:03:40Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:03:40Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"message":"feat(coding-agent): 压缩摘要的流式增量事件（compaction.delta）\n\n压缩对 UI 此前完全黑盒：completeSimple 等到终态才返回，压缩期间用户只\n能干等；opencode 的实践（消息流中摘要逐字上屏）证明过程可见能显著缓\n解长压缩的等待焦虑。本次建立流式增量协议，为后续「实时压缩卡片」铺\n轨：\n\n- runtime-core：SessionObservation 与 SessionEvent 新增 compaction.delta\n  （text 为本次增量片段，拼接即全量摘要）；session-events 映射与\n  observation 安全投影（该层内容安全语义只报 characterCount，正文走\n  SessionEvent 通道）同步扩展；\n- coding-agent：CompactionSummaryGenerationOptions 新增 onSummaryDelta；\n  deltaForwardingCompletion 包装 streamSimple 逐事件转发 text_delta，\n  返回值与 completeSimple 同构，直接注入 completion 位（generateCompaction\n  签名加可选 generationOptions 参数，向后兼容）；自动压缩策略把增量\n  上报为 compaction.delta observation；prefire 命中或扩展接管时不发\n  增量（后台预热不重放）。\n\n顺带修正 #9 的遗留：CompleteSummaryCandidateOptions.reasoning 类型此前\n钉死为字面量 \"high\"，#9 把值改为 \"low\" 后类型未扩（check:quick 不含\ntsc 故漏网），现扩为 \"low\" | \"high\"。\n\n测试：deltaForwardingCompletion 3 例（增量保序、thinking 事件不打扰、\nasync 回调不竞态、options 透传；显式 completion 优先不抢流式通路）。\nruntime-core 445 例、coding-agent 全包通过；两包 tsc 通过。","tree":{"sha":"e7f2882b5483d48270fe822818804e9223d519d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/e7f2882b5483d48270fe822818804e9223d519d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/b9d56269695af19d8aabf030c40927a0aeec41b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/b9d56269695af19d8aabf030c40927a0aeec41b6","node_id":"C_kwDOUIkr1toAKGI5ZDU2MjY5Njk1YWYxOWQ4YWFiZjAzMGM0MDkyN2EwYWVlYzQxYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","sha":"5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67"}],"sha":"b9d56269695af19d8aabf030c40927a0aeec41b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/b9d56269695af19d8aabf030c40927a0aeec41b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/d81d4e8576ca39cbbd08695e69bd4c57866c9b01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:48:11Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:48:11Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"message":"perf(coding-agent): 压缩估算的 usage 锚定校准与降级链预检\n\n两处独立但同属「长会话压缩又慢又险」的根因：\n\n一、估算校准（PI #779 思路的 AS 移植）。逐字口径（ASCII/4、CJK 1/字）\n看不见系统提示词、工具 schema 与缓存写放大，中文会话被系统性低估，\n压缩触发过晚甚至直接撞 provider 溢出。新增 ContextEstimateCalibration：\n从会话内最近两个 assistant usage 推导锚点（usage 反映的请求携带哪些\n消息，残差 = usage − 逐字估算），estimateContextTokens 把校准后的残差\n计入总估算。比例合法带 [0.5,5] 外的锚点拒收；连续两次向下突变冻结；\n固定残差封顶 60k；只补低估、不缩小。\n\n二、降级链预检。长会话（最需要压缩的场景）full 档几乎必然超过摘要\n模型输入窗口，旧流程要真发一次注定失败的请求、等 input-too-large\n报错再逐档重试。prefilterSummaryCandidates 用与触发判定同源的逐字\n口径先估各档，超预算的直接跳过；全部超限时保留最小档（宁降级不空\n链）；contextWindow 未知时维持旧行为。\n\n测试：校准 11 例（含 estimateContextTokens 消费面三态）、预检 6 例\n（含端到端：小窗口下首个请求已不含全量输出；拿掉接线实测变红）。\ncoding-agent 全包 1371 例通过，零连带破坏。\n\n基于 #9（速度双修）之上：compaction.ts 同文件重叠，建议先合 #9。","tree":{"sha":"407633686f858dec15dfddd7223db88de30b1290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/407633686f858dec15dfddd7223db88de30b1290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/d81d4e8576ca39cbbd08695e69bd4c57866c9b01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/d81d4e8576ca39cbbd08695e69bd4c57866c9b01","node_id":"C_kwDOUIkr1toAKGQ4MWQ0ZTg1NzZjYTM5Y2JiZDA4Njk1ZTY5YmQ0YzU3ODY2YzliMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","sha":"5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67"}],"sha":"d81d4e8576ca39cbbd08695e69bd4c57866c9b01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/d81d4e8576ca39cbbd08695e69bd4c57866c9b01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/5a5198b55b73bda3d119ad7693f8a518f7f74920/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:13:06Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:13:06Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"message":"perf(coding-agent): 压缩摘要生成的速度双修——推理降档与输出预算收敛\n\n上下文压缩的摘要生成此前以 reasoning:\"high\" 调用主模型，并给到\n0.8×reserveTokens（默认约 28.8k）的输出上限：推理模型的思考预算可\n达数十秒、超长摘要的生成时间随输出长度线性放大，两者叠加把一次压\n缩拖到数十秒，长会话里的体感就是「卡一下」。\n\n摘要是「复读并提炼」任务，不需要高强度推理，也不需要超长输出：\n\n- reasoning 由 \"high\" 降为 \"low\"（compaction.ts，主摘要一处）；\n- 主摘要 maxTokens 由 0.8×reserve 收敛为 min(8000, 0.25×reserve)；\n- 轮前缀摘要（turn prefix）同步由 0.5×reserve 收敛为\n  min(4000, 0.25×reserve)。\n\n新增回归测试 compaction-speed-params.test.ts：注入捕获 options 的\ncompletion，钉住真正发给模型的 maxTokens 与 reasoning；小 reserve 场\n景按比例收缩也有覆盖。还原旧实现时该测试实测失败（28800≠8000、\nhigh≠low），修复后通过；既有 compaction 测试 35 例全绿。\n\n后续（另开 PR，见压缩升级方案）：摘要模型分级可配、降级链预检、\nprefire 自适应。","tree":{"sha":"baf740be8e96290b3669a4b548647bd66175e387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/baf740be8e96290b3669a4b548647bd66175e387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/5a5198b55b73bda3d119ad7693f8a518f7f74920","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/5a5198b55b73bda3d119ad7693f8a518f7f74920","node_id":"C_kwDOUIkr1toAKDVhNTE5OGI1NWI3M2JkYTNkMTE5YWQ3NjkzZjhhNTE4ZjdmNzQ5MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","sha":"5a92185c3aded0a409b7481e926a8cd4dcd04a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits