{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/33ff1472ab95fc555e232003e6c38bc05aa33080/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:12:20Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:12:20Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"message":"fix(theme-ui): 流式短语压暗在任务停顿间隙不再滞留\n\nuseStreamingDisplayText 的 settle 只在 final（宿主已把 isStreamingTail\n翻 false）时启动，文字追平后若消息仍处于流式态——任务执行中两次工具\n调用之间的停顿——「最新短语略暗」会一直挂着：最后一句话长时间裂成\n前半亮、后半暗的两截，看起来像渲染损坏。\n\n追平即进入 settle 计时（150ms）：静默即恢复全亮，与 CSS 注释「撤掉包\n裹类就恢复全亮、DOM 不动」的承诺一致；新文本到达时布局效果里已有的\nclearTimeoutRef(settleTimerRef) 会取消计时，压暗随下一次放出重新出现，\n打出节奏感不变。span 分块结构按作者设计保留至卸载，不重建 DOM。\n\n新增生命周期测试（jsdom 真实定时器）覆盖四态：流出中带 -latest、静默\n追平后撤压暗、新文本到达压暗回归、流结束撤压暗且结构保留；旧行为下\n后两个症状断言实测失败，修复后全绿。\n\nfixes maomaochong-ai/open-astravia#1（关联验证过程）","tree":{"sha":"e819a4f00dcc2291dd21575645d3d81da12084d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/e819a4f00dcc2291dd21575645d3d81da12084d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/33ff1472ab95fc555e232003e6c38bc05aa33080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizat