"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/4db6d60e0f8a69a27ced6fdf0f6ee1147c3b00c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:20:43Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:20:43Z","email":"1047045074@QQ.COM","name":"zhangqingkun976"},"message":"fix(runtime-node): 搜索工具缺少 fd/rg 时给出可操作的安装指引\n\n自动下载固定从 GitHub Releases 取（managed-executables/catalog.ts），\n网络到不了 github.com 时（国内网络常见）必然失败。此前 grep、glob、\nfind、dir_tree 四个工具的报错只说明 could not be downloaded，不告诉\n用户怎么装，搜索能力直接不可用且用户无从下手。\n\n现在 fd 与 ripgrep 的缺失报错统一走 formatMissingCodingToolError：\n保留原句，补充失败原因（连不上 github.com）与 macOS / Linux /\nWindows / Termux 的手动安装命令；合同测试同步钉住新文案，并用\n「旧文案下会失败」的用例覆盖。远端（runtime-ssh）的提示按\nADR-0124 维持原有指引，不在本次范围。","tree":{"sha":"f261e82abb1668a55104c85eec3bc693a40415d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/f261e82abb1668a55104c85eec3bc693a40415d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/4db6d60e0f8a69a27ced6fdf0f6ee1147c3b00c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286644156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangqingkun976","id":286644156,"login":"zhangqingkun976","node_id":"U_kgDOERXXvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangqingkun976/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us