url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/45c2a1cebc30043e3558a9ad3d6f0bb3ce90a15a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:49:45Z","email":"nuwa.sky@outlook.com","name":"maomaochong-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:49:45Z","email":"nuwa.sky@outlook.com","name":"maomaochong-ai"},"message":"fix(desktop): CodeMirror LinkLayer ''onShowLinkUnderline'' undefined — 锁版本解决依赖冲突\n\n根因: monorepo 里多个 workspace 引用了不同 semver range 的 @codemirror/*\n和 @lezer/* 子包（@codemirror/lang-* 链各自拉 @codemirror/view ^6.17.0 / ^6.27.0），\nbun 虽然理论上会 dedupe，但 Vite bundler hoisting 仍可能把两份 BaseRenderLayer\n（link 子类）塞进同一 chunk，构造器注入的 linkLayer 对象来自不同 module 路径，\n其中一份 .onShowLinkUnderline 为 undefined → 侧边栏点击某些页面时炸。\n\n修复: 根 package.json overrides 强制所有子包使用锁定版本\n  @codemirror/view 6.43.7, state 6.7.1, language 6.12.4, commands 6.11.1,\n  autocomplete 6.20.3, lint 6.8.4\n  @lezer/common 1.2.3, highlight 1.2.3, lr 1.4.2\n然后 rm bun.lock && bun install && build:renderer\n\n验证: dist/renderer 新 chunk useExecutionModeSelectorModel-CFrTiqrN.js 构建成功；\nbun.lock 里 @codemirror/view 只剩 6.43.7 一份","tree":{"sha":"b4ed5075bd9e001e080fbe71a1a2b7ccdd40a066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/b4ed5075bd9e001e080fbe71a1a2b7ccdd40a066"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/45c2a1cebc30043e3558a9ad3d6f0bb3ce90a15a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"ve