-ai"},"message":"feat(website): 产品故事重构为 4 节点独立 Mock + 完整动态动画\n\n原 5 节点中 1-4 全是对话流程的不同阶段，合并为 1 个完整的\n对话工作区节点，内有完整的 phase 动画链：用户消息进入 →\nAI 呼吸思考 → 3 张工具卡交错渐入 + ✓ 标记弹出 → 结果代码块淡入。\n\n新增 3 个独立节点：\n- 设计面板：三栏（组件库 / 画布 / 属性）+ 画布组件交错出现\n- 自动化：Cron 任务列表 + 新建表单 + 状态徽章动画\n- 能力面板：保留原有 6 卡片交错滑入\n\nstory.ts 同步改为 4 步映射（sidebar 高亮/窗口标题切换）。","tree":{"sha":"6e9a267127b16cb623b480799daaeb99e0fbf270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/6e9a267127b16cb623b480799daaeb99e0fbf270"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/6f32079981fab6e0b889590924cf4b75e227063d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321062662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai","id":321062662,"login":"maomaochong-ai","node_id":"U_kgDOEyMHBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commit/6f32079981fab6e0b889590924cf4b75e227063d","node_id":"C_kwDOUIkr1toAKDZmMzIwNzk5ODFmYWI2ZTBiODg5NTkwOTI0Y2Y0Yjc1ZTIyNzA2M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/