"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/commits/5120c0b2ebf4ae539d967ab53010b45f3b7ad33c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:48:43Z","email":"nuwa.sky@outlook.com","name":"maomaochong-ai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:48:43Z","email":"nuwa.sky@outlook.com","name":"maomaochong-ai"},"message":"fix(docs-site): 升级 fumadocs 修复文档站构建爆栈\n\n文档站在本地和 Vercel 上都构建不出来，部署一直被卡住。根因是上游 fumadocs\n在把 Markdown 转回文本时无限递归，与页面内容无关，因此只升级依赖、不动文案。\n\n- fumadocs-core 与 fumadocs-ui 由 16.14.1 升到 16.15.17：旧版的 modHandler\n  返回裸函数，丢掉了 mdast-util-to-markdown 挂在行内标记上的 .peek 处理器，\n  使 container-phrasing 走错分支后经由 strong 无限自递归直至爆栈\n- 新版 i18n middleware 改用不带扩展名的 next/server，而 next 没有 exports\n  字段，只有 Node 原生 ESM（Vitest）受影响；在测试配置里内联 fumadocs-core\n  并补上别名绕开，生产构建不受影响\n- 补充发布说明","tree":{"sha":"a86edf1e10160621ef3f37d62cfc2b80605297a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/trees/a86edf1e10160621ef3f37d62cfc2b80605297a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maomaochong-ai/open-astravia/git/commits/5120c0b2ebf4ae539d967ab53010b45f3b7ad33c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/321062662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maomaochong-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mao