subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developeratexample","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hong-peng/cypress-coverage-writer/commits/7452f53cb4ff6b02ee0065094094bdd7db51f9ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T04:05:17Z","email":"developer@example.com","name":"developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T04:05:17Z","email":"developer@example.com","name":"developer"},"message":"feat: initial working state of cypress-coverage-writer workflow\n\nMulti-agent Cypress step-definition generator for React/UI5 MFEs.\nOrchestrator (feature_run.mjs) drives 14 subagents through 8 phases:\nPreflight → Worktree → Determine → FeatureAnalyze → MockData →\nScenarios → FinalCommit → Merge.\n\nIncludes:\n- Main workflow: feature_run.mjs + retrospect_run.mjs\n- 14 subagent definitions (cwp-preflight, cwp-player, cwp-tester,\n  cwp-error-fixer, cwp-feature-analyzer, cwp-mock-data, cwp-validator,\n  cwp-worktree, cwp-writer, cwp-determiner, cwp-retrospect,\n  cwp-retrospect-validate, cwp-applier, cwp-dead-end-analyzer)\n- Cypress runbook skills (feature-analyzer, mock-data, skeleton,\n  step-gen, error-fixer, shared)\n- Cross-run insight pool (llm-cypress-insights)\n- Enforcement hooks (subagent-guard, audit-isolation, dedup-read,\n  live-progress)\n- Anti-cheat architecture (AUDIT_FINAL.md)","tree":{"sha":"3955e582d5a0889805f9435d29cfb05e946d059c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hong-peng/cypress-coverage-writer/git/trees/3955e582d5a0889805f9435d29cfb05e946d059c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hong-peng/cypress-coverage-writer/git/commits/7452f53cb4ff6b02ee0065094094bdd7db51f9ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14004359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developeratexample/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u