nterminated turns\n\n- Preserve the native selection through mousedown on the \"Discuss with\n  AI\" button, which otherwise collapses the selection (and unmounts the\n  button) before click ever fires.\n- Fix effect-ordering so a highlight seeded on the widget''s first-ever\n  open isn''t immediately clobbered by the same-commit bookId reset.\n- Surface an error and unstick phase/streamingReply if an SSE stream\n  ends without a terminal frame (dropped connection, idle timeout).\n- Wrap the assistant-message persistence after a successful reply\n  stream in try/catch so a DB failure yields agent_error instead of\n  losing the reply with no terminal frame sent.\n- Clamp the discuss-selection button horizontally so it can''t render\n  off-screen near a viewport edge.\n- Correct a repository comment that claimed an index covers the\n  listMessages seq-ordered query; no such index exists.\n\nFound via code review of the branch containing #161/#162.","tree":{"sha":"0a126f29d436660ca1d4b9c9a53f5099d65c2504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/0a126f29d436660ca1d4b9c9a53f5099d65c2504"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/1a16ba35d7e303227c89b1ed866b7a0387aaa9f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events",