owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/30bf87c52f03fd9bd398a940defbcaf08061fa88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:53:42Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:53:42Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"fix(agent-tab): autoscroll far enough to reveal the composer/Send button\n\nThe scroll sentinel sat right after the message list, so scrolling to\nit left the nudge/composer/Send button below the fold - the same gap\nwhether triggered by new content or by reopening/switching into the\ntab. Moved the sentinel to the true end of the tab''s content, after\nthe composer, so autoscrolling now brings the Send button into view\ntoo, not just the latest message text.\n\nVerified in the browser (including mid-stream, while the button reads\n\"Thinking...\") that it stays fully within the scroll container''s\nvisible bounds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016VgTix8cdJ1CwZQhpFpiPc","tree":{"sha":"7731a06a5c9fce67440b2c320f221ea92e2911d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/7731a06a5c9fce67440b2c320f221ea92e2911d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/30bf87c52f03fd9bd398a940defbcaf08061fa88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://