ma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/2bebb47cc1f964f3355a0059863446e3def4c2cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:39:23Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:39:23Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"fix(chat-widget): pointer cursor on the widget''s clickable controls\n\nNative <button>s don''t get a pointer cursor for free; the widget''s\nlauncher, tab switcher, close button, Send/Ask submits, and the\nhighlight-to-discuss floating action all showed the default arrow\ncursor on hover instead of a pointer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016VgTix8cdJ1CwZQhpFpiPc","tree":{"sha":"528e2ad1d9a02133bd83503fca480f8888fd269c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/528e2ad1d9a02133bd83503fca480f8888fd269c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/2bebb47cc1f964f3355a0059863446e3def4c2cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/2bebb47cc1f964f3355a0059863446e3def4c2cb","node_id":"C_kwDOUIpLSdoAKDJiZWJiNDdjYzFmOTY0ZjMzNTVhMDA1OTg2MzQ0NmUzZGVmNGMyY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1","sha":"ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1"}],"sha":"2bebb47cc1f964f3355a0059863446e3def4c2cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/2bebb47cc1f964f3355a0059863446e3def4c2cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:36:34Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:36:34Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"feat(chat-widget): escalate the AI visuals - more glow, more magic\n\nThe first pass felt too subtle. Escalates it: a slow-spinning conic\naura plus twinkling sparkle particles behind the launcher (previously\njust a soft pulse ring), an actual light-bloom (box-shadow, not just a\nborder line) around the open panel that brightens further while\nstreaming, a stronger/faster shimmer sweep with a matching glow on\nin-progress text, a glowing bloom under the active tab, and a soft\nglow on highlighted-passage quotes. Still built only from the existing\n--primary/--chart-2/--chart-3 gradient - just more of it, not a new\ncolour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016VgTix8cdJ1CwZQhpFpiPc","tree":{"sha":"0823ee8de579562244b9f559a525fac1319427b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/0823ee8de579562244b9f559a525fac1319427b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1","node_id":"C_kwDOUIpLSdoAKGFjMGVkNDJiYTkxNmI3MTY0ODBjYzg2MWQwNzlhZjhmY2Y5NWZkYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940","sha":"9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940"}],"sha":"ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/ac0ed42ba916b716480cc861d079af8fcf95fdc1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:33:21Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:33:21Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"feat(chat-widget): AI-styled visuals and reply autoscroll\n\nGives the chat widget a more distinctly \"AI\" look, built entirely from\nthe existing --primary/--chart-2/--chart-3 token gradient (never a new\ncolour): a pulsing glow behind the launcher (now a Sparkles icon), an\nanimated gradient border around the open panel that quickens while\neither tab is streaming a reply, a gradient sweep over in-progress\ntext, pulsing dots alongside \"Thinking...\", and a gradient left border\non highlighted-passage quotes.\n\nChatWidgetProvider gains isStreaming/setIsStreaming so either tab can\nreport its own streaming state up to the shared panel chrome without\ncoupling them together.\n\nAlso fixes the Agent tab not autoscrolling as a reply streams in - the\nmessage list now tracks a trailing sentinel via scrollIntoView so the\nnewest text stays in view without a manual scroll.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016VgTix8cdJ1CwZQhpFpiPc","tree":{"sha":"dc8e192c90829de1f3be5f8a5337d5878a9d81bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/dc8e192c90829de1f3be5f8a5337d5878a9d81bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940","node_id":"C_kwDOUIpLSdoAKDk5NjdlNjIyY2Y0YTQ3MTFjZWZiZGMzOWM0ZWJkN2QwM2QyZGU5NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/a68b1003c95b64cb951e68513ccc1e7578bd051b","sha":"a68b1003c95b64cb951e68513ccc1e7578bd051b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/a68b1003c95b64cb951e68513ccc1e7578bd051b"}],"sha":"9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/9967e622cf4a4711cefbdc39c4ebd7d03d2de940"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/a68b1003c95b64cb951e68513ccc1e7578bd051b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:12:01Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:12:01Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"feat(reader): highlight-to-discuss on the reader/source page (#161)\n\nSelecting a passage in the chapter article (Summary or Source view)\nsurfaces a \"Discuss with AI\" action via the browser''s native\ngetSelection, positioned from the selection''s own bounding rect. A\nbelow-minimum or collapsed selection shows no action; an over-length\none is truncated to the backend''s own highlightedPassage bound rather\nthan rejected.\n\nChoosing the action clears the native selection and seeds the widget''s\nAgent tab with the passage via a new pendingHighlight on\nChatWidgetProvider, opening the widget onto that tab immediately - no\nconfirmation step, even if it was showing something else. The Agent\ntab now renders a composer for a seeded highlight even before any\nthread exists, since threads previously could only start via a\ndev-only trigger.\n\nuse-swipe-nav''s touch handler also now suppresses the chapter-swipe\ngesture when a text selection is active at touch-end, so a\ndrag-to-select on mobile can''t also read as a chapter swipe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016VgTix8cdJ1CwZQhpFpiPc","tree":{"sha":"5372d6f26a38fad159da03f69cb6e6385537e66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/5372d6f26a38fad159da03f69cb6e6385537e66b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/a68b1003c95b64cb951e68513ccc1e7578bd051b","ve