c71abcdbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/7d2e78e46d4a40c317e1f0e171394f7cc6ae6b3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:15:45Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:15:45Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"refactor(library): address deposit-slot review feedback\n\n- DepositSlot reads the book-limit standing from useUsage itself, so\n  Toolbar and Library no longer thread an atBookLimit prop through.\n- checkDrop returns a stable rejection code; the slot maps it to copy,\n  keeping user-facing strings out of the logic module. Drop the 0-byte\n  guard - pdf.js and the server are the validators.\n- Drag-over now lifts the chute lip and shows an inset rule; a rejected\n  drop gives a brief shake (suppressed under prefers-reduced-motion).\n- Duplicate warning no longer hidden when the PDF also fails to parse.\n- Deposit slip uses DialogFooter rather than a hand-rolled bar; drop the\n  unused curly quotes and the \"…\" ellipsis for the repo''s \"...\".\n- Shared test-support/http jsonRes helper; empty-state copy tightened.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GVsNNxcqThH6iG4tUGNvLp","tree":{"sha":"946844e4c20a4a810f01937ef4e2204cc6d2aa95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/946844e4c20a4a810f01937ef4e2204cc6d2aa95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/7d2e78e46d4a40c317e1f0e171394f7cc6ae6b3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/7d2e78e46d4a40c317e1f0e171394f7cc6ae6b3f","node_id":"C_kwDOUIpLSdoAKDdkMmU3OGU0NmQ0YTQwYzMxN2UxZjBlMTcxMzk0ZjdjYzZhZTZiM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/73b806dd7893b919af6caf6087aebf6ea433cfb8","sha":"73b806dd7893b919af6caf6087aebf6ea433cfb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/73b806dd7893b919af6caf6087aebf6ea433cfb8"}],"sha":"7d2e78e46d4a40c317e1f0e171394f7cc6ae6b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/7d2e78e46d4a40c317e1f0e171394f7cc6ae6b3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/73b806dd7893b919af6caf6087aebf6ea433cfb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:07:44Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:07:44Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"feat(library): PDF deposit slot with a confirmation slip\n\nReplace the toolbar \"Upload PDF\" button with a chute you feed a PDF -\ndrop one on it or click to browse. A drop never uploads straight away:\nit opens the deposit slip, a modal that shows the first-page cover, the\nfilename, the size and the page count (parsed locally with pdf.js,\nlazy-loaded) before a deliberate Deposit. The slip owns the whole\nthree-step handoff and stays open through it, so an S3 or register\nerror lands right there with a Try again.\n\n- Same-filename + exact-size match against the library shows a soft\n  \"already in your library\" warning; Deposit becomes \"Upload anyway\".\n- Bad drops (non-PDF, over 50 MB, more than one file) are turned away at\n  the slot before the slip opens. An unreadable PDF opens the slip but\n  blocks the deposit.\n- At the plan''s book ceiling the slot renders a spent state linking to\n  /activity; the 402 race is still caught by the shared limit notice.\n- The empty library renders the slot as a large panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GVsNNxcqThH6iG4tUGNvLp","tree":{"sha":"1a2202a6c28f34f96a448e5f703206a5166e0448","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/1a2202a6c28f34f96a448e5f703206a5166e0448"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/73b806dd7893b919af6caf6087aebf6ea433cfb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti