/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/01eeb663b5d9489c86c4bbd0e5046a11028e09f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:16:09Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:16:09Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"fix(library): stacked card layout for the worklist below sm\n\nOn a phone the four-column grid squashed the title to one word per line\nand overlapped the status chip. Below sm the grid is now dropped: each\nbook is a card - title (clamped to two lines), author, a status/progress\nmeta row, and always-visible Open/Delete actions. The column header is\nhidden and the horizontal-scroll fallback only applies from sm up. The\ndesktop worklist is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"f97f590b24878c42fda823d93e34025c1cabe8e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/f97f590b24878c42fda823d93e34025c1cabe8e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/01eeb663b5d9489c86c4bbd0e5046a11028e09f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c