date":"2026-09-09T16:40:37Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"feat(activity): add the /activity usage dashboard\n\nA dedicated screen for a reader''s own usage: lifetime totals (books\nuploaded, questions asked, pages ingested), the current question\nallowance, two trailing-12-month bar charts, and the most-asked books.\n\n- contracts: ActivityDto\n- server-core: ActivityRepository (all /activity reads in one place) and\n  buildMonthlyActivity (pure, unit-tested zero-fill of the 12-month\n  series, UTC calendar months)\n- api: GET /me/activity; the question-allowance computation is now shared\n  with GET /me/usage instead of duplicated\n- client: /activity route + \"Activity\" nav item; Recharts via the vendored\n  shadcn chart component; --chart-* tokens (light + dark)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GVsNNxcqThH6iG4tUGNvLp","tree":{"sha":"ac14915035907a9ee5d4c32242687ca28247d536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/ac14915035907a9ee5d4c32242687ca28247d536"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/f48ee6fb73bc557b491d81c9c5b91299e3d62099","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https