FmOGY5Y2RhYzdmODExMzI0ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cal3574/scriptorium/commit/d90d91998e1e5be8310e671b4dd4a96d77f4805b","sha":"d90d91998e1e5be8310e671b4dd4a96d77f4805b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/d90d91998e1e5be8310e671b4dd4a96d77f4805b"}],"sha":"9b2f9328c3976b58c405faf8f9cdac7f811324f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/9b2f9328c3976b58c405faf8f9cdac7f811324f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/calhallgamma","id":286878949,"login":"calhallgamma","node_id":"U_kgDOERls5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/commits/d90d91998e1e5be8310e671b4dd4a96d77f4805b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:46:37Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:46:47Z","email":"callum.hall@gamma.co.uk","name":"Callum"},"message":"fix(providers): salvage pages a Gemini batch drops instead of failing the book (#109)\n\nA dense 10-page batch sometimes comes back with fewer sentinels than asked for\n(the model merges or omits a page). At temperature 0 the retry returns the same\nthing, so after 3 attempts the whole book failed with \"expected page sentinels\n[...] but got [...]\".\n\n- parseSentinelPagesLenient: when the sentinels a response did emit are an\n  in-order subset of the batch''s pages, return what parsed plus the `missing`\n  list rather than throwing. A genuinely scrambled response (extra or\n  out-of-order sentinel) still throws SentinelMismatchError. Strict\n  parseSentinelPages is kept, implemented on top of the lenient one.\n- transcribeWithRetry retries a short response, keeps the fullest attempt, and\n  after exhaustion hands back the partial instead of throwing (throws only when\n  nothing usable came back).\n- extractBatch salvages the missing pages one at a time (same path as a\n  safety block); a page that still won''t transcribe becomes a placeholder and\n  marks the extraction partial. salvagePageByPage generalised to salvagePages.\n- maxOutputTokens pinned to the Flash-Lite ceiling (65536) so a code- or\n  table-heavy batch is not silently truncated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DfRohYcLDuvurHNPhhcvEP","tree":{"sha":"d1068e8af6241864841e6b77ea8e90cbd1976fbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/trees/d1068e8af6241864841e6b77ea8e90cbd1976fbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cal3574/scriptorium/git/commits/d90d91998e1e5be8310e671b4dd4a96d77f4805b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286878949?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calhallgamma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ca