"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/6dfd359039963c5301ec12b532cfac1463016cad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:03:04Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:03:04Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"message":"Ferramentas, vocabulário do projeto e diagnóstico dos flows\n\n- `npm run lint` existia no package.json e nunca tinha rodado: 7 erros\n  acumulados, agora zero. O eslint precisava saber que jest.setup.js e os testes\n  rodam no Node, não no bundle do app.\n- `npm run apk:release` restringe o build às arquiteturas ARM. O APK universal\n  levava 34 MB de bibliotecas x86 que só rodam em emulador: 72 MB caíram\n  para 38 MB.\n- CONTEXT.md nomeia os conceitos do domínio e lista os valores que viraram\n  contrato com aparelhos instalados. Existe no lugar de uma pasta types/: tipo\n  mora junto da regra que o usa, e o que faltava era um índice, não uma gaveta.\n- .maestro/README.md registra a dependência de ordem entre flows (uma falha no\n  onboarding vira cinco em cascata) e duas armadilhas do iOS: o teclado que\n  cobre o elemento no instante do toque, e testID em <Text> aninhado que não\n  existe nem para o teste nem para o VoiceOver.","tree":{"sha":"66b180b4ff657dc97d563153d124b026d9a74e01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/trees/66b180b4ff657dc97d563153d124b026d9a74e01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/commits/6dfd359039963c5301ec12b532cfac1463016cad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/6dfd359039963c5301ec12b532cfac1463016cad","node_id":"C_kwDOUJSkUdoAKDZkZmQzNTkwMzk5NjNjNTMwMWVjMTJiNTMyY2ZhYzE0NjMwMTZjYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5","sha":"9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5"}],"sha":"6dfd359039963c5301ec12b532cfac1463016cad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/6dfd359039963c5301ec12b532cfac1463016cad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:02:53Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:02:53Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"message":"Código em inglês, com os valores que viraram contrato preservados\n\n341 identificadores em português caíram para 50, e nenhum arquivo tem mais nome\nem português. Pastas, componentes, props, chaves de i18n, comentários e testIDs\nacompanham.\n\nO que NÃO mudou, e por quê:\n\n- `@gabarita/sessao` guarda o token de quem já está logado; renomear deslogaria\n  a base instalada em troca de nada que o usuário perceba.\n- `@gabarita/preferencias` é lido pelo adapter de migração.\n- Os motivos de report (`enunciado_incompleto` e companhia) são validados pela\n  API e já têm linhas gravadas com eles.\n- Os códigos do INEP (CH/CN/LC/MT, H1–H30) são o vocabulário do domínio.\n\nBugs corrigidos no caminho:\n\n- A tela de abertura mostrava \"Gabarita\", o nome antigo.\n- \"Gabarito comentado\" e o menu de reportar problema estavam fora do i18n:\n  apareciam em português com a interface em inglês.\n- A home montava \"%{pct}% de acerto · %{total} respondidas\" com template string,\n  e a renomeação trocou \"respondidas\" por \"answered\" dentro da frase — a tela\n  saía metade em cada idioma.\n- `home.greeting` esperava %{nome} e o código passava { name }: a saudação\n  perdia o nome.\n- `toLocaleDateString(''pt-BR'')` cravado formatava data em padrão brasileiro com\n  a interface em inglês.\n- O X de fechar a sessão e o botão de sair da conta compartilhavam\n  testID=\"sign-out\".\n\nOs testes de i18n cobrem cada uma dessas classes: chave ausente, texto fora do\nt(), frase montada com template string, marcador que não bate com o argumento,\nlocale fixo e plural incompleto.","tree":{"sha":"131079f252ae77839b7576c955d81fd98e6122b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/trees/131079f252ae77839b7576c955d81fd98e6122b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/commits/9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5","node_id":"C_kwDOUJSkUdoAKDkzMjVmNTc1Yzk5MmQ2Y2RhY2U3OTRmOWIzMmFmMmIyYjcxN2NjYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46","sha":"00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46"}],"sha":"9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/9325f575c992d6cdace794f9b32af2b2b717cca5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:02:39Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:02:39Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"message":"Primitivas de UI, parser de markdown testável e migração de preferências\n\n**ui-kit/primitives**: Screen, Card, Button, Centered e BackButton. As telas\nredigitavam a mesma estrutura — `height: 52` aparecia escrito à mão em oito\narquivos num projeto que já tinha tokens, e `tela`/`conteudo`/`botao` se\nrepetiam em 5, 9 e 7 arquivos. Agora mudar a altura do botão é uma linha.\n\n**rich-text**: o renderizador de markdown das questões não sabe o que é uma\nquestão do ENEM, então saiu de modules/ para shared/. O parser virou módulo\npuro, e com ele veio a correção de um defeito que afetava 42 questões:\n`toBlocks` tratava a linha inteira como imagem quando encontrava uma, e o texto\ndos dois lados sumia da tela sem erro nenhum. \"Observe a figura ![](u) e\nresponda\" agora produz três blocos.\n\n**preferences/migrate**: a v1.0 gravou tema, escala e idioma em português sob\n`@gabarita/preferencias`, e esses aparelhos existem. Sem tradução na leitura, o\napp cairia no padrão em silêncio e quem já usava perderia as preferências. O\nadapter aceita os dois formatos e regrava no novo.","tree":{"sha":"4b13f54a9805a9f4dac0398cbab02eaaa9d62f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/trees/4b13f54a9805a9f4dac0398cbab02eaaa9d62f33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/commits/00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46","node_id":"C_kwDOUJSkUdoAKDAwOTg1ZjhiMTViM2ExYmU3NDBmZDRkYWIzYzk2NzM0MmUzM2FmNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb","sha":"46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb"}],"sha":"00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/00985f8b15b3a1be740fd4dab3c967342e33af46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:00:58Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:00:58Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"message":"Module Federation só na publicação\n\nO plugin quebra o Metro dev server no RN 0.87, e as duas posições do mesmo\nswitch falham:\n\n- `unstable_patchInitializeCore: true` injeta `require(''mf:init-host'')` logo\n  após o ''use strict'' do InitializeCore, antes de\n  `setUpDefaltReactNativeEnvironment` criar o ErrorUtils global. O app morre em\n  \"cannot read property ''setGlobalHandler'' of undefined\".\n- Com a flag desligada, o host federado nunca inicializa e o react compartilhado\n  não resolve: \"Invalid loadShareSync call\" (RUNTIME-006).\n\nReproduzido com cache limpo. Como PLATFORM só existe nos scripts de deploy, ele\ndistingue publicação de desenvolvimento: o dev server passa a rodar Metro puro.\nNão custa nada aqui porque o app não consome remotes — os quatro exposes existem\npara serem publicados, não carregados de volta.\n\nOs exposes passam a inglês (./session, ./stats, ./profile) junto com o resto do\ncódigo. docs/validar-federation.md traz o roteiro de validação, incluindo o que\nnão funciona como demonstração: o build não é determinístico, então comparar\nhash de bundle entre builds mostra ruído. Quem entrega o isolamento é o Zephyr\nno upload (1/12 assets num build sem alteração), não o bundler na saída.","tree":{"sha":"a4bf7fef56c535398154f6bc5c5bce189c8e630e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/trees/a4bf7fef56c535398154f6bc5c5bce189c8e630e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/commits/46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb","node_id":"C_kwDOUJSkUdoAKDQ2YmYyMzU0ZDcxZjVlM2Q0OGUwODJlYjFlODA3ZjMxZWU4NDIyZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7","sha":"2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7"}],"sha":"46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/46bf2354d71f5e3d48e082eb1e807f31ee8422fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:01:08Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:01:08Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"message":"English README with architecture diagram and app recording\n\nThe repository is a learning exercise about how Zephyr works with Metro, and the\nREADME now says that up front instead of reading like a product page.\n\n- docs/media/demo.gif: 18s of the answering loop recorded on the simulator,\n  driven by the same Maestro flow the E2E suite uses.\n- Four screenshots for the screens the recording does not linger on.\n- architecture-light.svg and architecture-dark.svg, swapped by <picture> since\n  GitHub does not apply prefers-color-scheme inside an SVG. The diagram draws\n  the difference between the two build commands, which is the thing worth\n  showing: one publishes, the other writes a file and exits with code 0.\n- docs/zephyr.md and the config comments translated, with the five rough edges\n  and the evidence behind each.","tree":{"sha":"66bc7ce18e3b1e9b14b0f0235721079af381df23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/trees/66bc7ce18e3b1e9b14b0f0235721079af381df23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/git/commits/2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7","node_id":"C_kwDOUJSkUdoAKDJhMTg2MjIyNGFhZGM0MTAwNzZjM2Q4ZDUwMTcyYjNlZjRmNzI1Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commit/c4744ecde08fb165d3bae0c206ff8314d6b14fdb","sha":"c4744ecde08fb165d3bae0c206ff8314d6b14fdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/c4744ecde08fb165d3bae0c206ff8314d6b14fdb"}],"sha":"2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/2a1862224aadc410076c3d8d50172b3ef4f725f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38509926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/goul4rt","id":38509926,"login":"goul4rt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTA5OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goul4rt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/goul4rt/mobile-react-native-standart/commits/c4744ecde08fb165d3bae0c206ff8314d6b14fdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:45:59Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:45:59Z","email":"aroldogooulart@gmail.com","name":"goul4rt"},"message":"README: explica que o backend é opcional para rodar a integração\n\nSem a API no ar o app mostra a tela de falha de conexão com retry, que é o\ncomportamento correto e está coberto por E2E. O que importa aqui (metro.config,\nreact-native.config e o fluxo de publicação) não depende dela.","tree":{"sha":"80812f0cded6ea8b275e5e916975c5a4bcb8259e","url":"http