ru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/88a3f47e5aac9a90f9d3d6c4576b121f7bbdda26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:07:44Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:07:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): categories in a tree - departments and their categories (#365)\n\nCategories are now departments and the categories under them, two levels. CategoryTree checks a parent on create and on a new PUT /api/categories/{id}/parent (Admin, audited CategoryMoved): it exists, is not the category, has no parent of its own, and a category with categories under it stays a department. Deleting a department with categories under it is a worded 409 instead of the foreign key''s 500, and filtering the listing by a department includes its categories'' products. The storefront groups the filter under departments, offers the departments as the hero''s chips and shows a breadcrumb on a product page; the back office lists the tree, creates under a department and moves a category. The seed files each vertical under a department, checked by the loader; Bruno covers the move and its refusals. Closes #363.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67865c1f3a0a957d9d539015e525b63c6c021066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/67865c1f3a0a957d9d539015e525b63c6c021066"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/88a3f47e5aac9a90f9d3d6c4576b121f7bbdda26","verification":{"payload":"tree 67865c1f3a0a957d9d539015e525b63c6c021066\nparent a0d65fd93e07773ebc56834117c6ef5eb3af7fc4\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791461264 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791461264 +0700\n\nfeat(catalog): categories in a tree - departments and their categories (#365)\n\nCategories are now departments and the categories under them, two levels. CategoryTree checks a parent on create and on a new PUT /api/categories/{id}/parent (Admin, audited CategoryMoved): it exists, is not the category, has no parent of its own, and a category with categories under it stays a department. Deleting a department with categories under it is a worded 409 instead of the foreign key''s 500, and filtering the listing by a department includes its categories'' products. The storefront groups the filter under departments, offers the departments as the hero''s chips and shows a breadcrumb on a product page; the back office lists the tree, creates under a department and moves a category. The seed files each vertical under a department, checked by the loader; Bruno covers the move and its refusals. Closes #363.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx4eQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyO0QAEEMIzMNvaAAw4lqTYhu6igC\n8bFV6Jx6w0gfJW2f3z/VOC+RPBOTY+cNJIEU02ebDDSt1ucuNpzRZ5YnKRkpWeXL\n6OiuJ9AjSOPZ1td3se8qDjlIxigF