17c6ef5eb3af7fc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/a0d65fd93e07773ebc56834117c6ef5eb3af7fc4"}],"sha":"88a3f47e5aac9a90f9d3d6c4576b121f7bbdda26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/88a3f47e5aac9a90f9d3d6c4576b121f7bbdda26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/a0d65fd93e07773ebc56834117c6ef5eb3af7fc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:58:33Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:58:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): serve the catalogue''s public reads from memory (#362)\n\nNothing in the system cached. Catalog now answers anonymous reads of the listing, a product, the categories and a shop page from memory - ASP.NET Core output caching, 200s only, never a request with Authorization, kept apart by query and the negotiated language and currency, 30 s (Caching:CatalogueSeconds, 0 off, checked at start). CatalogueWrites, an EF Core interceptor on CatalogDbContext, empties it after the commit of any statement writing the catalogue''s own tables - EF saves, guarded SQL and consumers alike - and never on a rollback, a view or a saved product; nothing that decides (pricing, stock, ownership) is cached. Measured over four warm browse runs each way on one stack: listing median 10-20 ms to 2.4-3.0 ms, p95 38-78 ms to 4.7-6.0 ms, no errors - the scenario''s best case, said so in the evaluation. report.py lays browse runs out as one before/after table. Closes #361.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0513f289b0266ea095d6a4524e26fd3a84a83017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/0513f289b0266ea095d6a4524e26fd3a84a83017"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/a0d65fd93e07773ebc56834117c6ef5eb3af7fc4","verification":{"payload":"tree 0513f289b0266ea095d6a4524e26fd3a84a83017\nparent b29bfc5d75f7abc4f6e011c65f8e4090cd19f903\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791449913 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791449913 +0700\n\nfeat(catalog): serve the catalogue''s public reads from memory (#362)\n\nNothing in the system cached. Catalog now answers anonymous reads of the listing, a product, the categories and a shop page from memory - ASP.NET Core output caching, 200s only, never a request with Authorization, kept apart by query and the negotiated language and currency, 30 s (Caching:CatalogueSeconds, 0 off, checked at start). CatalogueWrites, an EF Core interceptor on CatalogDbContext, empties it after the commit of any statement writing the catalogue''s own tables - EF saves, guarded SQL and consumers alike - and never on a rollback, a view or a saved product; nothing that decides (pricing, stock, ownership) is cached. Measured over four warm browse runs each way on one stack: listing median 10-20 ms to 2.4-3.0 ms, p95 38-78 ms to 4.7-6.0 ms, no errors - the scenario''s best case, said so in the evaluation. report.py lays browse runs out as one before/after table. Closes #361.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx1s5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbpAQAFlwIQVebZE24SIM9o2MCsDe\nrUVMeiyxYhxctL/vETQJp29Alhq+m1snVTEJeyp5lajL0Tu9Kspp5NszYb59QN8S\nHEDzduXvlTM6aRj0c0AG2t8hkjSDV5ZXJJVfcje94B0HyzrUdZHnm4YXPY8m0f2n\n0kPfy1AgbBRVxP8XLOqdeKX5J6hs13YhUkXLspYLvU7oVw1T4PDARWfb6A/g2rMq\nYfVt/U1ndlb8CNmHxSN9cdnVjS3CdcImihUhFksImui2uKHIAoPJch/JwIjCjYkm\nuLIfvLpXs48iY9zKxyT8qWtanEt9fH9+DesITucA0cVYht5d1CdNgl07G735EMoO\nbzRItH8kfeIdEpVZpWU2mQfkRxcZ18QtyXot5kr4aMJgDP5S1Cnz6cOoEA8xOY+5\nL1Wgd3EjnmpbCsP4PjlLZDwMepi6EdwLG8JpzgsCXpnSpSwuRKT8FbXoh/f5Wc8/\nv0V4H8kQKqbQ02Z58DeF0vBKE9iG4+bU/S9U2m3pIANHncLr4eyURxXEoszJyExi\nurbTn5dki3/pLXdJKTI6VPWV0+gN8YX5o56aTRMAsn5Dn3EpAL0Bgl8JQO+FSj7i\nb314zGhtp1VKTH9r52WcpI+fNrZ5gXYFOuuYHGokuFgMQ/OWtyyXJHsVwX1uJ7A1\nxDrT2yWPnuqI9z7twJHL\n=MPdA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:58:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/a0d65fd93e07773ebc56834117c6ef5eb3af7fc4","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKGEwZDY1ZmQ5M2UwNzc3M2ViYzU2ODM0MTE3YzZlZjVlYjNhZjdmYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/b29bfc5d75f7abc4f6e011c65f8e4090cd19f903","sha":"b29bfc5d75f7abc4f6e011c65f8e4090cd19f903","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/b29bfc5d75f7abc4f6e011c65f8e4090cd19f903"}],"sha":"a0d65fd93e07773ebc56834117c6ef5eb3af7fc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/a0d65fd93e07773ebc56834117c6ef5eb3af7fc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/b29bfc5d75f7abc4f6e011c65f8e4090cd19f903/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:28:14Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:28:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): a shop for anything, not only cameras (#360)\n\nThe model already sold anything - free-text variant options, categories as rows - but the shop still read like a camera shop. The storefront''s search box, hero, open-shop and add-variant copy no longer name a kind of goods (vi and en), the no-photograph tile is a parcel instead of an aperture, and a wording test keeps camera words out of the common, catalog and seller bundles. The seed is one file per vertical in seed/catalogue/ - cameras plus electronics, fashion, home, books and sports, 41 products and 77 variants - loaded and validated by seed/catalogue.py (duplicate SKUs or slugs across files, missing English, unknown categories, mismatched options, fractional dong, three-decimal dollars, negative stock), which CI runs; the seeder and the cleaner read through it, the cleaner always keeps every vertical and deletes nothing when the files fail their checks. Closes #359.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5c67c978cf353f658a6eae3bff4c2c16a15429a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/b5c67c978cf353f658a6eae3bff4c2c16a15429a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/b29bfc5d75f7abc4f6e011c65f8e4090cd19f903","verification":{"payload":"tree b5c67c978cf353f658a6eae3bff4c2c16a15429a\nparent f3dbac451e0fb5e9b0b9813e271c185802271c23\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791448094 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791448094 +0700\n\nfeat(catalog): a shop for anything, not only cameras (#360)\n\nThe model already sold anything - free-text variant options, categories as rows - but the shop still read like a camera shop. The storefront''s search box, hero, open-shop and add-variant copy no longer name a kind of goods (vi and en), the no-photograph tile is a parcel instead of an aperture, and a wording test keeps camera words out of the common, catalog and seller bundles. The seed is one file per vertical in seed/catalogue/ - cameras plus electronics, fashion, home, books and sports, 41 products and 77 variants - loaded and validated by seed/catalogue.py (duplicate SKUs or slugs across files, missing English, unknown categories, mismatched options, fractional dong, three-decimal dollars, negative stock), which CI runs; the seeder and the cleaner read through it, the cleaner always keeps every vertical and deletes nothing when the files fail their checks. Closes #359.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx1QeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACi0QAF7Ij5HkMO6UV2WhTlAK6Em3\nzLpwOeTSeqgN+lNlr7mwww5opFT7RBWkPGzdIdkLetSf3cWm2r6qHkuwo3D3TWQQ\nsWZ6btZQPunD/aMEgIbXCxu7XD3PZsQRBSTR8F4vrzlEf0g5dsDDay4Iczo3Udr9\nshipC73ZQSfV8vbX0Dx1tquJ5Upjvj9Cnqni7Z7AuTw1ycPZ6BImUmDB97vgLHUk\nFSa0v+beOx3vlk+ezMSsOnnQallPh3TnQiqXFNGwJOQ4TXFIf3wV5ikJXviseqiu\n5xddALFg3K4e262c6wL86D5Be9ukp0/n42SKUA2BovD3Acwt4U1rXfJMAoVPUpps\nzLdv6UXHeqeeqphouCJ2kW5VRtwl14oTxZIRMJrrO0MGLGWAyOcjeVhQl7p6+mC4\n85C5lK1gjiGGBuCJJlMvbV2GGbyBndCCYfV3fekez9We4ewvGgNa9b8uTHmlSabK\naCRI0gNtyDVa0o43LWWHxARp4tVOFRpCRhdZh+7ESqmfckSWikIl2BEJPSAChiqX\nHhlbH8PqhNNuSHf8liOygYjFbYn8moVF6wSVtsx9Iuq+V+9B8WyMgdYjKujRIPgO\nl/XhHvyQVEQQa7J/syKTwnBfzAqcusaTXObH1XG9yLjIpxo5UEWIlNwtiuuYzYyy\noW3xOcFoCqLLomGALJTc\n=DnzY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:28:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/