b.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/f3dbac451e0fb5e9b0b9813e271c185802271c23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:40:04Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:40:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): MassTransit pinned to exactly 8.3.6, no patch proposed either (#358)\n\nDependabot proposed the MassTransit 8.3.7 patch (#357) within the hour of #354, which had ignored only minors and majors. CI cannot show whether a version carries #353''s regression - it lies somewhere after 8.3.6 and only fault.sh broker sees it - so a green pull request proves nothing, patch or not. Every MassTransit update is now ignored, MassTransitVersionTests holds exactly 8.3.6 in every csproj and in what the build resolved (a mutation to 8.3.7 fails both), and a vulnerable MassTransit still fails the build. #357 closed. Refs #353.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57f496cb9c9dd4426f85b6501571a838b122de15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/57f496cb9c9dd4426f85b6501571a838b122de15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/f3dbac451e0fb5e9b0b9813e271c185802271c23","verification":{"payload":"tree 57f496cb9c9dd4426f85b6501571a838b122de15\nparent 42533c6bcb37353d2071b41d69c8fa1a8276f5d0\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791294004 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791294004 +0700\n\nfix(deps): MassTransit pinned to exactly 8.3.6, no patch proposed either (#358)\n\nDependabot proposed the MassTransit 8.3.7 patch (#357) within the hour of #354, which had ignored only minors and majors. CI cannot show whether a version carries #353''s regression - it lies somewhere after 8.3.6 and only fault.sh broker sees it - so a green pull request proves nothing, patch or not. Every MassTransit update is now ignored, MassTransitVersionTests holds exactly 8.3.6 in every csproj and in what the build resolved (a mutation to 8.3.7 fails both), and a vulnerable MassTransit still fails the build. #357 closed. Refs #353.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxPo0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvyMQAB6s4zJpKtVtI511kiu8X109\nA7d0T0N4JkljSXF01GsntmUHqH8vq6HrenO1Ui3VmmsCXdBW4YKpJMTYk56VXwtm\nBo6Hu1Xkc9ruWifa9v86NrHkGGzVZEUtODX+Br06E1gIRujraFW2JnHpyV3jWkoT\ncwjQWfk5d8pbP+bkKl3CSrRWoDjX6wCCOfufNONDTVp/FMVX6YCsBTrMUAI9lA2t\nzjHHh0kqsncAYAKRjtonQGyJGsCUvVAkqtach4JdrDDpH40uYoOIpWoMS83EJ5Wc\nGj6LUHZsOKSYlgdwmkHBsOSXvboKrDOh0E5idSlmkTmpzWFrkp+IhQUj/HcY6rMf\nSCjnCMS8Olt4UzzCjzSEfgxiLtuVRZBQ9YBDQh2MdQGiuNKHysd+PuN3b1MkqBBC\nxPiifKRkLndPiOz/INRnzdwE8i2Wry3ARHOvCiZhUEu6EwTlpqiWHHk+j/HZv2qa\na8YzBML+uCuHAzwYAQijQrrzABU9RzKJjMsmlMQpWgxZ5XsBnnmSVEHtpqztlw/m\nY3dkFc+6H41NfNiaY7YbTSln8q14DKqeBlkP4STWPXkxs2YdurysA/rgTJMJbqSI\nQI/W84W+177Iiv7BM7v1YmOdcFYzN0ivq1UgPcZ/RyvXAtQb3e6+Lj3owQ34Ozrx\nLRLV+QYWCYF0elynSsyG\n=EJ3Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T13:40:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_u