or-and-patch group. The three such pull requests from the first run (#315, #329, #330) are closed with the reason. Closes #331.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e6587145054a103a40f52174ed9b1a3c08ceb4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/8e6587145054a103a40f52174ed9b1a3c08ceb4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/149641e770c03c29f92bbb5703dc85cdc53709a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e6587145054a103a40f52174ed9b1a3c08ceb4c\nparent 16c1ea30dc1d56b14cb76f86a5e718e16681f66b\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791255381 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791255381 +0700\n\nchore(infra): Dependabot proposes only what may be merged (#332)\n\nDependabot ignores MassTransit majors (9.x is a commercial licence) and PostgreSQL majors (a new major cannot read the old data directory: a planned dump and restore, never a bump), and groups majors into one pull request per ecosystem beside the minor-and-patch group. The three such pull requests from the first run (#315, #329, #330) are closed with the reason. Closes #331.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxGNVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUG0QACOoRUBxKqjT+g+iYNpz5sbQ\nlfHVDdl8um6GOKv66tpPqSAYiJEMmAkEbrmVpy2jmjA4/cpwkxazYH4GFDY5VIW0\nkwHrcfUsk86b6Or+GzmIjBtj0k6fHMFR92nNIvP2K0NPjUMRu43kBU+pOPXUJ7Rd\nTDJFClLQOQXGUPM3AcXsv2dn0iOZiYIPy4w4hA4FTR2p2LFKshbQ+urgZ5BGwfId\nACLJwkTW3pUJRUxnHdO/bBl5OVoPB542VOtJeRFzHLuvmOtmx6HOHOUuk7w1+3OC\nK20lFYejTWLbfMGvCj1Yc1dTOy/Aay2nWNELAWLoLMptHeMy+deonIc/6VZkhxb8\nZjzwqh2qUfDzPZLcWOPr7wkb/sp3fRwQ4lh0FAljriuaZPDoQgp4p/0WcgRHoT98\nXn57MDZhbAeomL0vdIrg1NJLzcu74A6a/n6bHGJFoNOdS97Ou7b8lW/MUlAO4aYr\ncVSiLbh3zwBqujkttlt9PglVxQT7HhMFT4iWQ7TM5qG437Oe7o9t4mW1h+6W0adv\nasrzSIv+F3Y6i/XgFwTs3QsXssM+dIPOEv95/kuS8BeUm2OjvT2B/Ha7gX