jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/9b60f4f605057fa243e7304e26f41a6241c065d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:34:15Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:34:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: the report''s top-down documents (#327)\n\nAn architecture overview with one diagram of every part and the request and saga paths; a deployment guide from a bare server to a running shop, with what is not exercised yet; the evaluation chapter (tests, mutations, the last-unit race, latency, resilience, security, the defects measurement found, limitations) with every number linked to its run; and a demo script through every role. Closes #295.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6eb3312b44be60717db96d2c4c7844992d21e56c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/6eb3312b44be60717db96d2c4c7844992d21e56c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/9b60f4f605057fa243e7304e26f41a6241c065d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 6eb3312b44be60717db96d2c4c7844992d21e56c\nparent 63cc20eb58d544d69f30351790b0033c02f86efe\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791221655 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791221655 +0700\n\ndocs: the report''s top-down documents (#327)\n\nAn architecture overview with one diagram of every part and the request and saga paths; a deployment guide from a bare server to a running shop, with what is not exercised yet; the evaluation chapter (tests, mutations, the last-unit race, latency, resilience, security, the defects measurement found, limitations) with every number linked to its run; and a demo script through every role. Closes #295.\n\nCo-Autho