7304e26f41a6241c065d2","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDliNjBmNGY2MDUwNTdmYTI0M2U3MzA0ZTI2ZjQxYTYyNDFjMDY1ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/63cc20eb58d544d69f30351790b0033c02f86efe","sha":"63cc20eb58d544d69f30351790b0033c02f86efe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/63cc20eb58d544d69f30351790b0033c02f86efe"}],"sha":"9b60f4f605057fa243e7304e26f41a6241c065d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/9b60f4f605057fa243e7304e26f41a6241c065d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/63cc20eb58d544d69f30351790b0033c02f86efe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:16:32Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:16:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(client): security headers on both apps (#325)\n\nBoth images send a Content-Security-Policy (scripts, fonts and connections from their own origin only; inline styles allowed for Sonner and TipTap, research D2), nosniff, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy and COOP/COEP/CORP, from one snippet every nginx location includes, with server_tokens off. Caddy adds HSTS and drops its Server header. The image check pins the exact policy on every kind of answer; every Playwright test fails on a CSP, COEP or CORP violation; ZAP''s header rules are FAIL. Closes #294.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea6440022f53556088e678479c27f6f3398077e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/ea6440022f53556088e678479c27f6f3398077e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/63cc20eb58d544d69f30351790b0033c02f86efe","verification":{"payload":"tree ea6440022f53556088e678479c27f6f3398077e2\nparent 0be6e174e2bb1ef8d7ec425d7af995675d25dca3\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791220592 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791220592 +0700\n\nfix(client): security headers on both apps (#325)\n\nBoth images send a Content-Security-Policy (scripts, fonts and connections from their own origin only; inline styles allowed for Sonner and TipTap, research D2), nosniff, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy and COOP/COEP/CORP, from one snippet every nginx location includes, with server_tokens off. Caddy adds HSTS and drops its Server header. The image check pins the exact policy on every kind of answer; every Playwright test fails on a CSP, COEP or CORP violation; ZAP''s header rules are FAIL. Closes #294.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9twCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfBwQAHGVrL2OtG/Fp2cGXTAxxB+Y\nlnyKcFRIv3Aup