","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/d1c0a73cd05e44fec1eeafed593099f4c53a49a2"}],"sha":"0be6e174e2bb1ef8d7ec425d7af995675d25dca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/0be6e174e2bb1ef8d7ec425d7af995675d25dca3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/d1c0a73cd05e44fec1eeafed593099f4c53a49a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:35:51Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:35:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shared): a message delivered twice at once is consumed once, not faulted (#308)\n\nAfter a broker outage one message can be in flight twice; both consumes inserted its inbox row and the second faulted with 23505 on AK_InboxState_MessageId_ConsumerId into an _error queue. The transient policy now retries that one constraint, and the inbox drops the duplicate; every other unique violation still faults at once. InboxRedeliveryTests reproduces the race on the real inbox. Closes #306.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f80e4a124bfb1033cab3b3773b5df47a7aff764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/6f80e4a124bfb1033cab3b3773b5df47a7aff764"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/d1c0a73cd05e44fec1eeafed593099f4c53a49a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f80e4a124bfb1033cab3b3773b5df47a7aff764\nparent ab90d6101b8dcba47a8ae3b8cb5387ec24fc88f4\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791214551 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791214551 +0700\n\nfix(shared): a message delivered twice at once is consumed once, not faulted (#308)\n\nAfter a broker outage one message can be in flight twice; both consumes inserted its inbox row and the second faulted with 23505 on AK_InboxState_MessageId_ConsumerId into an _error queue. The transient policy now retries that one constraint, and the inbox drops the duplicate; every other unique violation still faults at once. InboxRedeliveryTests reproduces the race on the real inbox. Closes #306.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw8PXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz1oQAITX80vijJ4f6GJw0IdNDHXI\nQ4QcoQZfg0yU6NJErfIoTinohebdDIqmKcwCSON9KaZfPsTpamoHsJkm/UFsQ1Rw\nYzuwPhW91rUubjP6W01a8HYcMm8AC4TQAPwTjGw/NHo2WggSuk32l4OFQ2UfLCx5\n9jUA3jm4eiNMV2PI8Vn57lCbK1t/nyRLBo2lUvulQeT7PFI5MDtJr/xr3bdtqzs/\nRULOzrpKUYOBVhtMe7XHrnkiTiY1mQfmckun8JN6uQUUg4Wiujsmgjp11GgH3Ymu\nHxbLKdNrojOMoIuplg1vXWKaEq4bsA/VPqpuVLufvq/YnM5Qp7h8q9nrXxrqnDIP\nTCLvvyuNgVhIW5+OwQKnrF7RxWiRYnFpmruFWBbMiifzHjouzqabY7ue0HQJuf/Z\nMOPZmEv3uIBmHcGrberCfmGIj1IDiHWID3EIEj//xizme3VPXBYUGF1RYGA1f9Ea\nPosPcVOnaiJyG7I/btGSOQ6ur