u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/ab90d6101b8dcba47a8ae3b8cb5387ec24fc88f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:16:27Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:16:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(infra): metrics - Prometheus and Grafana dashboards (#307)\n\nEvery service pushes OpenTelemetry metrics (requests, HttpClient, runtime, MassTransit, Npgsql) to Prometheus''s OTLP receiver when METRICS_ENDPOINT is set; RabbitMQ is scraped. Grafana opens on a provisioned, generated \"E-commerce overview\". Orders by status, settle-time percentiles and each outbox''s backlog are gauges sampled from committed rows, never counters a retried consume would count twice. Production publishes neither port. Closes #292.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0e8b7b75190fa02cce8ec7edd939865dc015c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/d0e8b7b75190fa02cce8ec7edd939865dc015c25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/ab90d6101b8dcba47a8ae3b8cb5387ec24fc88f4","verification":{"payload":"tree d0e8b7b75190fa02cce8ec7edd939865dc015c25\nparent a6b2c113e9b6d39b322a77cb02ae798213cb609d\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791213387 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791213387 +0700\n\nfeat(infra): metrics - Prometheus and Grafana dashboards (#307)\n\nEvery service pushes OpenTelemetry metrics (requests, HttpClient, runtime, MassTransit, Npgsql) to Prometheus''s OTLP receiver when METRICS_ENDPOINT is set; RabbitMQ is scraped. Grafana opens on a provisioned, generated \"E-commerce overview\". Orders by status, settle-time percentiles and each outbox''s backlog are gauges sampled from committed rows, never counters a retried consume would count twice. Production publishes neither port. Closes #292.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw79LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg/MQAKBYJ0kLQVYeJxhgM2l8euzu\n5CT6HL5J74kDQpZuQmleAHse3W+G1HZzwd7MTWN86GTGlNf/qIiJ57BTRYbC6zmS\np4sLspT/g/yYBH0qJswN5zTY86lAKo370iDmPX2+fr/BHXEHat6rlcX7X3vOuPpf\nI6y4q32B6YSVjl6um9K5wOPMwVrr2Jh/8EuGlLthcRIyf2Lom8DKz0AdzzqRiGUQ\nasR5btcjHmURPRKDV1iQfyC07TlCLx//6EVPc/5BTbcOwk5GlpM3BXam0VkAOj9K\nxvX0oSQPH7Ulrd+oTMoRB9UUYfvyUMvzwIzf2wSPI7Qa4pwLxIQ8+sUSgLsiqv1n\nmuivOlkn4TqdrPrrUEyt1s+WGGyfgsddp08UCUgtUD1ODqZwGNDrz1jMDAU2yF0X\n4BpaBChj8UwIwpzo9Mc1CG9JrnbJ2T24eXB/f3TzrxkfPEsuMEim1f7syVQuPsyz\nqa38CHyfwhpuAPOPmcwDVsQgRGIo0PeD0qtw4V4PITvWhkXuq6goTWgHQ6rtjreo\nnH8V0yeUdEJNTyv9j1092uCJ7ZTGqSeIDE6V4icsbCVciJX8Zp7AFWh5ztOcUOuT\n+r0uhF6aUjXVHRQAdSFdvkqKIBuE0B4MsuoNsp7QpGmfxaRSfPqutGkSmH0KZguF\nXWq8iwdeGwudZuGSycwG\n=Gj5x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T15:16:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url"