}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/a6b2c113e9b6d39b322a77cb02ae798213cb609d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:36:59Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:36:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(resilience): checkout survives a service or the broker going down (#305)\n\nCloses #291. server/loadtest/fault.sh payment|broker|orchestrator|inventory runs steady checkouts and, 15 s in, stops Payment or RabbitMQ for 60 s, restarts the orchestrator, or pauses Inventory for 30 s, then brings it back; afterwards every order must be terminal, units sold equal units deducted, nothing held and no message in an error queue. All four pass with nothing lost and no customer error; per-order settle times before, during and after each fault, and how long the backlog took to clear, are in docs/testing/resilience-results.md, generated from the kept runs. The broker outage drains slowest (89 s after recovery for 63 s down) - filed as #304.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d1dd137942c36cfb346b92b5e6d592ae7a34393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/1d1dd137942c36cfb346b92b5e6d592ae7a34393"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/a6b2c113e9b6d39b322a77cb02ae798213cb609d","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d1dd137942c36cfb346b92b5e6d592ae7a34393\nparent 1ebea7b1f41bdc6e4e680c78b72561ec64fb9192\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791038219 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791038219 +0700\n\ntest(resilience): checkout survives a service or the broker going down (#305)\n\nCloses #291. server/loadtest/fault.sh payment|broker|orchestrator|inventory runs steady checkouts and, 15 s in, stops Payment or RabbitMQ for 60 s, restarts the orchestrator, or pauses Inventory for 30 s, then brings it back; afterwards every order must be terminal, units sold equal units deducted, nothing held and no message in an error queue. All four pass with nothing lost and no customer error; per-order settle times before, during and after each fault, and how long the backlog took to clear, are in docs/testing/resilience-results.md, generated from the kept runs. The broker outage drains slowest (89 s after recovery for 63 s down) - filed as #304.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwRMLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPyQQAAGym8h5ZbhWz6Mc06PmFgfA\nmr7OfSDnkN4lzl0lzAWjk4HPoUZIbevNr8QkOAz/1OmJfccNFw2KIN5xuNBZwlYY\nn7XuHB2Ld2xpjh9Vid8HlhDF6Z8KlbpfDsfhWNslU78520Xxdlow010AiPw79Xn3\nqtkh7nxd0y1KZIuG/ePDIcGHjvCQTXG75Iu9tOmpYopKR023IG+Ba6pFA3K2iB8G\nqeyoNpS1+BAYZmR5tkA6LlR142/V8W7/yK/lmAvFAMAz1wKkvlt2+TOauwA44cs3\n1zd2v2wBLTsvK3OrtnuXePTWwuw+p6Flm3nTGZcPEN3HSO4Hf9toqI+H5RnbRJ8H\nV2bpnMtZXLXLgJa3BW/mvaRXcp7ns546u3VihVEWKbZMDggJD07SeM0MIfJA8t7Q\nJC7brPKvTimmjWOaFAtOwx4FiKkcRidp3BB+Tl+nOlppqnnTGGqmIP44IphtgcYk\nKO8EWdKu74EfA1rNQ9StQqPlCucNdAcOYQa452gg5B5ExBLXXhv25s+UlwSFGvWR\n1wfnC0TdBf6R/SVomRf2qQcaB6OrdfePcHfXSYXIxi3W+HQ8WUKlHy7widWbaTkz\nf4CbsDdGkxcROGKP2hwxR/qSB/MIGshmmvCJDVpCY0TqL/TkMLAIZpBPiUL3I6SD\n5WTCIkeTML/