":"a769e2abe3cc6d998f13b4a1f942533365f6440e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/a769e2abe3cc6d998f13b4a1f942533365f6440e"}],"sha":"d8ea56b841ee0346daed9337a8eb588355b70cbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/d8ea56b841ee0346daed9337a8eb588355b70cbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/a769e2abe3cc6d998f13b4a1f942533365f6440e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:31:44Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:31:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shared): retry a consumer''s transient database failure (#300)\n\nCloses #299. Found by the load test of #290: under steady checkouts of one product, a paid order''s OrderCompletedEvent faulted to Inventory''s error queue on 40001 (the EF outbox consumes at REPEATABLE READ) with no retry anywhere, leaving its units held for the expiry sweeper to resell. TransientRetry.UseTransientRetry() (Ecommerce.Shared/Messaging) retries only 40001, 40P01 and transient connections, with jittered backoff, before the EF outbox on every endpoint of every service; Identity and Cart get a callback for it. Tested on MassTransit''s harness (5 tests, both mutations caught); the same load run afterwards held every invariant with every error queue empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12aa061523457686a6952cccee9ad149f76b6600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/12aa061523457686a6952cccee9ad149f76b6600"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/a769e2abe3cc6d998f13b4a1f942533365f6440e","verification":{"payload":"tree 12aa061523457686a6952cccee9ad149f76b6600\nparent 415d148d3ac68d3bbbf5d39357afa5f653f89fdb\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791027104 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791027104 +0700\n\nfix(shared): retry a consumer''s transient database failure (#300)\n\nCloses #299. Found by the load test of #290: under steady checkouts of one product, a paid order''s OrderCompletedEvent faulted to Inventory''s error queue on 40001 (the EF outbox consumes at REPEATABLE READ) with no retry anywhere, leaving its units held for the expiry sweeper to resell. TransientRetry.UseTransientRetry() (Ecommerce.Shared/Messaging) retries only 40001, 40P01 and transient connections, with jittered backoff, before the EF outbox on every endpoint of every service; Identity and Cart get a callback for it. Tested on MassTransit''s harness (5 tests, both mutations caught); the same load run afterwards held every invariant with every error queue empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n