s seam (ADR-004): with PAYMENT_PROVIDER=VnPay, the saga''s request opens a checkout and decides nothing; the owner gets a freshly signed HMAC-SHA512 link that expires before the saga''s payment timeout; VNPay''s IPN decides once - signature in fixed time, merchant, amount, a guarded claim and the one payment row with the saga''s reply in one transaction - answered in VNPay''s codes. Dong only; the stub stays the default; movesMoney on /health. A separately written simulator lets development and CI pay and cancel end to end (saga job scenarios 3 and 4). The storefront offers Pay with VNPay and a return page that never reads the outcome from the address. Refunds stay recorded; the real sandbox needs the merchant''s registration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58bff14e547e574fb2fdaaf40abf136883792de0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/58bff14e547e574fb2fdaaf40abf136883792de0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/415d148d3ac68d3bbbf5d39357afa5f653f89fdb","verification":{"payload":"tree 58bff14e547e574fb2fdaaf40abf136883792de0\nparent efbc5f2041014d6aab3e09e60f839cb96b33b4eb\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791024730 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791024730 +0700\n\nfeat(payment): pay with VNPay (sandbox) instead of the stub (#298)\n\nCloses #289. VNPay as a redirect gateway behind Payment''s seam (ADR-004): with PAYMENT_PROVIDER=VnPay, the saga''s request opens a checkout and decides nothing; the owner gets a freshly signed HMAC-SHA512 link that expires before the saga''s payment timeout; VNPay''s IPN decides once - signature in fixed time, merchant, amount, a guarded claim and the one payment row with the saga''s reply in one transaction - answered in VNPay''s codes. Dong only; the stub stays the default; movesMoney on /health. A separately written simulator lets development and CI pay and cancel end to end (saga job scenarios 3 and 4). The storefront offers Pay with VNPay and a return page that never reads the outcome from the address. Refunds stay recorded; the real sandbox needs the merchant''s registration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwN5aCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn30QAJQtiiPV69RIq+fXvdzI2sQi\nTT7izVfzYWl+3OrEp5ncFT0YPjw0Ghg9vBnRgabsk+TP64LaJLUIDWG0rJenf1MN\nN44JIPRfNDrT65kCTMVKNiOS6WZuRqdEvv9Q1gTORk0zbspawf3KgOAm0AhCrgOi\n4Hk07j/hB2yIB+1b1UEcw/nUekz/o6xh6WoivQkl7XBvvs9HGHhXty1+PLLoLdL/\n+Bc/Cyh6B8NKKm0osP/GtGbbieN2d33Fpcyl4+19ZwVubGBfmk8Y/XcXI9kk92lC\nyaUXWjaSpP1GTCyKz+ap6WGsL85F9c9xvkJcDEy8nO8hO/xorb3Ls5mo9OXujV1k\n1iQRWvijU0AW6mPg+t0rz1uaqVvybECdxbWWWu9at2qzLnBkD3sP5xaUUBoOen6Y\njDQIH8kMA7FzUId5BcA+TAx6zu5lr7+Y8NspsuaxRcfQ+MWbpyC6n4lbUckPRDda\n+3Wu4pmFtrPU2PPl7IuqO0nmCQNr10vfblzzD0WgqtAaopJM2QgNqOQ0niH/b1we\nLILMsPmfCJ9RFiUAH0FlkMZ29U9BC8bPaoagriEdiltUkk97VItfMvT+rau28vgz\nEWlDHtxpfI1PaKnl8UHm505outYNzNsfGUfuv06bA+vWjcAautG/TiQcdoFflyjq\nDb7mlRC9AWIJBBX0XmHB\n=jXoX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T10:52:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/415d148d3ac68d3bbbf5d39357afa5f653f89fdb","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDQxNWQxNDhkM2FjNjhkM2JiYmY1ZDM5MzU3YWZhNWY2NTNmODlmZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/efbc5f2041014d6aab3e09e60f839cb96b33b4eb","sha":"efbc5f2041014d6aab3e09e60f839cb96b33b4eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/efbc5f2041014d6aab3e09e60f839cb96b33b4eb"}],"sha":"415d148d3ac68d3bbbf5d39357afa5f653f89fdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/415d148d3ac68d3bbbf5d39357afa5f653f89fdb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/efbc5f2041014d6aab3e09e60f839cb96b33b4eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:54:37Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:54:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(infra): deploy and roll back from CI (#297)\n\nCloses #288. A hand-run deploy workflow (dry run by default) ships a release''s own compose files over SSH with the host key pinned, and runs server/deploy/deploy.sh: registry check before anything changes, a lock, up --wait, smoke checks through Caddy, releases.log, and the previous release put back by itself on failure; ''previous'' rolls back. CI''s deploy-dry-run tests the script''s decisions with stubs and renders the production overlay from the shipped files, and publish waits for it. Verified for real with published images: deploy, an automatic rollback from a broken release, redeploy, and previous. RabbitMQ gets a start period after the first deploy on empty volumes failed on it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bb3684f113b92a86e6d4957e0ab6328129a0eed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/3bb3684f113b92a86e6d4957e0ab6328129a0eed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/efbc5f2041014d6aab3e09e60f839cb96b33b4eb","verification":{"payload":"tree 3bb3684f113b92a86e6d4957e0ab6328129a0eed\nparent 359dc8253e78d1316a62a40dbf57b10fddaae04c\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791014077 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791014077 +0700\n\nfeat(infra): deploy and roll back from CI (#297)\n\nCloses #288. A hand-run deploy workflow (dry run by default) ships a release''s own compose files over SSH with the host key pinned, and runs server/deploy/deploy.sh: registry check before anything changes, a lock, up --wait, smoke checks through Caddy, releases.log, and the previous release put back by itself on failure; ''previous'' rolls back. CI''s deploy-dry-run tests the script''s decisions with stubs and renders the production overlay from the shipped files, and publish waits for it. Verified for real with published images: deploy, an automatic rollback from a broken release, redeploy, and previous. RabbitMQ gets a start period after the first deploy on empty volumes failed on it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwLS9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFQgQACI3JENH35O6laXr98yN+KzI\nV0VvqlT9rRk19qHYYHT9b7xi6rOcCtsKEeovchL649pT3JQmW1BUwtTNwyl1oL0I\noQXKu9U6C2GHatn1wSEfTJ/k7Ap6qpCJYQ2nT0TzDOPDjIwlT8rgs4+aQeWtGDdU\nW9PC2es5gXdbul+DLPqDIE2pcjCy5IMISyO0ldAn6F+Tvav3/0DhNbQG4fomtxg+\nefMUVrNP5oIBHbqSoNlQ9mcgBa4wTxxIJzH4l/QNy3583LX6pZQktwl6yd6m8RkR\nz02VRatIGl2i3xd+52VZV1uJLPNcyBTLm+QAcz6im35Wx8tpH9BUpgqtFHKhTSBu\nMuHVXpipk4tsKQ4sgxjx1MRhmCEB417BaMverxjtEMJVy94lK/OmufceGReT3LRq\nNCMU0NIVO5nluWS/P11BIhPcpgK1JAJtO+VtabhzvKYd5Y5USvX55WVzMEZFqwCp\nRazcIQBADD37Kog7fKsmU+tS0wvmPDqpG538cARWdqa1bNnQtSsIG5KT3EUUDvQB\n0R1kS3X0K4uqK3S999jyYR4ajKW6a+EF93kqVwPq8XkM6s2NsBerVwKtVlKBcoFd\nha9EXFPVkiR87Zt3R9UbSVgMjbME2HErj0nieOvE5JxU8GfohM8+mpwBCNDg2/gr\nLlB6e9AOPMffJz1gn1/7\n=vPR1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T07:54:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url