nts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/359dc8253e78d1316a62a40dbf57b10fddaae04c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:54:16Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:54:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(infra): a production stack served over HTTPS (#296)\n\nCloses #287. docker-compose.prod.yml runs the published sha- images behind Caddy (automatic HTTPS for SHOP_DOMAIN and PORTAL_DOMAIN), publishes no other port, and builds nothing. The gateway reads two trusted hops (GATEWAY_FORWARD_LIMIT); Identity sends through a real SMTP provider over STARTTLS and refuses half-configured settings at startup. Verified locally over HTTPS: Playwright 8/8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48c8ee71a7efc48a6847bd16d3b2e62b683d1a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/48c8ee71a7efc48a6847bd16d3b2e62b683d1a80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/359dc8253e78d1316a62a40dbf57b10fddaae04c","verification":{"payload":"tree 48c8ee71a7efc48a6847bd16d3b2e62b683d1a80\nparent 18af798656c9a03c384a7e6df819464cf02e98cc\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791010456 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791010456 +0700\n\nfeat(infra): a production stack served over HTTPS (#296)\n\nCloses #287. docker-compose.prod.yml runs the published sha- images behind Caddy (automatic HTTPS for SHOP_DOMAIN and PORTAL_DOMAIN), publishes no other port, and builds nothing. The gateway reads two trusted hops (GATEWAY_FORWARD_LIMIT); Identity sends through a real SMTP provider over STARTTLS and refuses half-configured settings at startup. Verified locally over HTTPS: Playwright 8/8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>