i.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/dcae08dea8ce0acb1d48de6d3f63a1cefb647294/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:17:44Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:17:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(identity): a one-time handoff from the storefront to the back office (#286)\n\nThe last step of ADR-003. \"Management platform\" takes a single-use handoff (staff with two-factor sign-in only; SHA-256 in back_office_handoffs, 30 seconds, once) to portal.../auth/callback#code=... - the fragment, which no server logs. The back office removes it, redeems it with one guarded UPDATE and gets a two-factor challenge, never a session: the handoff replaces the password, not the code. Anything failing opens the ordinary sign-in. specs/140.\n\nCloses #279\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffe679cea78f17f3cd022daa711f8f97f5a1379a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/ffe679cea78f17f3cd022daa711f8f97f5a1379a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-