DOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/71b0a52381389ee982bb32fb52b7519b238f24b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:56:18Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:56:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(shared): a separate token audience for the back office (#285)\n\nThe second line behind specs/138, held by every service. Back-office sessions'' access tokens are issued for JwtSettings:BackOfficeAudience (EcommerceBackOffice; an empty setting is the default too); every service accepts both audiences, and AddJwtAuthentication drops Admin and Moderator from any token not issued for the back office, right after the revocation check. specs/139.\n\nCloses #280\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5025cf99ee5e4dcb3b16589ac37a0b303fb34c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/f5025cf99ee5e4dcb3b16589ac37a0b303fb34c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/71b0a52381389ee982bb32fb52b7519b238f24b4","verification":{"payload":"tree f5025cf99ee5e4dcb3b16589ac37a0b303fb34c4\nparent 482c00f0319466aa4a4334b39f2e756383eff108\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790978178 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790978178 +0700\n\nfeat(shared): a separate token audience for the back office (#285)\n\nThe second line behind specs/138, held by every service. Back-office sessions'' access tokens are issued for JwtSettings:BackOfficeAudience (EcommerceBackOffice; an empty setting is the default too); every service accepts both audiences, and AddJwtAuthentication drops Admin and Moderator from any token not issued for the back office, right after the revocation check. specs/139.\n\nCloses #280\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwCiCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiREQAKtHBi1wiBMkTDN0XSuHHOnv\nmBhHHSsT/2utzk2emmPolh4NsW1hH1x68RRZ8mawUgrJUADepTKZ47sZLu2X3wwR\na0xX7+QwZuxDbrusRrnRE93/au7Dp0gae7w5tw9C5XjDhwzC63zWMUyAdVXbXMd2\nvEBJPyEcMcqac2/630wVarG+bnPnJmwFcG54dS1jXVIVSXfquPhny/4LZZeoQuSj\nhs5i6F0TvzrUH6ZLzKgVrLkXRdDQg+QTTxv9H9w5yvZ4EbxmWhjl7BBDlHnQl10n\nkzSQ0Wv4NezzFNOq5hcHQ+NJbT9il1iIEggySoY5q5+nvZJAtrsAaLO/251CzA1G\n5CUdheOvwUhVwmZBBJFxOpervtjDGMscfDRoB61tXPNNRJlXlm4tL2m+KiyFQbNr\nSn9G5sRWPoWZeOcSmyXpZQ9VtGF6/8E2vtBFusq2d1xQjxgn9NaDJruc4wOCmFS9\nk27PQAiGCeBryAcVA7tdX2JnqEU5OadZfxg9YJVpxU8SFiNaIZihEbsHtzhCB3hX\nWTjp4ejOb3v4gutDlVFwWgcW/fEni++BCYgdMAcgx/xQP1FN+ljihmWWW68I3qQu\nMnfBS0Vt152UfRfJcc7aUSc/WgLMseYaMfFSXVcZ34dy3bJZbnKpIth/WSrjSFdY\nBhzMsGaZAMdV+GT20G2i\n=fgKW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T21:56:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_eve