ttps://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/482c00f0319466aa4a4334b39f2e756383eff108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:39:08Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:39:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(identity): staff roles only in a back-office session (#284)\n\nThe fourth step of ADR-003. Identity records which app made each session - refresh_tokens.Client, from the Origin of the request that creates it against BackOffice:Origins, carried across rotation; null reads as the storefront - and writes Admin/Moderator only into a back-office session verified with a code. AuthResponse.StaffAccount keeps the storefront offering the back office. The verify scripts, seed scripts, Bruno and Playwright sign in as the back office. specs/138.\n\nCloses #278\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a63897eb30676cc7b2c3103fc2ab1505e658efe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/2a63897eb30676cc7b2c3103fc2ab1505e658efe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/482c00f0319466aa4a4334b39f2e756383eff108","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a63897eb30676cc7b2c3103fc2ab1505e658efe\nparent b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790977148 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790977148 +0700\n\nfeat(identity): staff roles only in a back-office session (#284)\n\nThe fourth step of ADR-003. Identity records which app made each session - refresh_tokens.Client, from the Origin of the request that creates it against BackOffice:Origins, carried across rotation; null reads as the storefront - and writes Admin/Moderator only into a back-office session verified with a code. AuthResponse.StaffAccount keeps the storefront offering the back office. The verify scripts, seed scripts, Bruno and Playwright sign in as the back office. specs/138.\n\nCloses #278\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwCR8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYGEQABOFyzjBBbEW7R3RtgDeSinv\nvUsxQR9/uTwK7DAcVnmnqWTRLxhpLICFvGHXtXzfkkrKh9HmVWIpTIKSw8z66wGH\nKXtXXEWqc7VrGq6/w2Ip8mE8NWM8BPtgzFoo60IM5wQkTh88mm40txCwpI2rIDqB\nmPXmsDGfS9icEObbS+aJVjhqPtBbo7k9ho6gxB1N6h4YusXBJgVdQc3dJqk++MwV\nn/Qlh2nQdv2E/SFzYcqtAwcLVOR8i8kPt8XN/xHvZPNX/sshzaoRqmyBgKAKzDxf\ndwDqbfinSghiurvgh8HAW2Era8Zp9gKuWnIF501eqBLsJbcOEDeyaGLCjkx7xwBU\nFa6F/AZhL2qCR8gIJeyK9n6HLSYUFETeeukUUoA7jC4PG23+8AKZwUMyZ61BuVF5\nD//6ZCr9OlyUeu++EjILlDgi6G5am1rxheC2JTnisenn3j7eBgGShkzf4I+jmULR\n0oYn9IH+5fZmglYinluyo4mZVTt/M5KWyTr2fAUigstGSBpE0ZqSWGEbulDn+bDB\ngFqGFc+UgyxpWFWN83YIrRgptnNxjn+5x0HPBa+gjrzKHpEoY9nb+byCABht3XuU\naULN0sfii2lgQP/ctmIzLV8f+e3gVVNbRm5/qTZUgTw/o/bpbS8jg0zJ096DRCnN\nR7QEAKbnw+WPc3NE3j01\n=u7qb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T21:39:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/482c00f0319466aa4a4334b39f2e756383eff108","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDQ4MmMwMGYwMzE5NDY2YWE0YTQzMzRiMzlmMmU3NTYzODNlZmYxMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610","sha":"b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610"}],"sha":"482c00f0319466aa4a4334b39f2e756383eff108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/482c00f0319466aa4a4334b39f2e756383eff108"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:23:18Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:23:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(client): the admin and moderator console moves to the back office (#283)\n\nThe third step of ADR-003. The 21 console pages, the console''s layout and their tests move from the storefront to apps/back-office, at the same paths without /admin; the 36 components both apps draw move to packages/core/src/components. Each app learns the other''s address at run time (/app-config.js); the storefront redirects /admin/* and notice links into the console to the back office, and links staff there by a full navigation. Closing a shop moves to the back office. specs/137.\n\nCloses #277\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54de39c055d3d91d39e26a1833647efd9ab2de82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/54de39c055d3d91d39e26a1833647efd9ab2de82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610","verification":{"payload":"tree 54de39c055d3d91d39e26a1833647efd9ab2de82\nparent 5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790976198 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790976198 +0700\n\nfeat(client): the admin and moderator console moves to the back office (#283)\n\nThe third step of ADR-003. The 21 console pages, the console''s layout and their tests move from the storefront to apps/back-office, at the same paths without /admin; the 36 components both apps draw move to packages/core/src/components. Each app learns the other''s address at run time (/app-config.js); the storefront redirects /admin/* and notice links into the console to the back office, and links staff there by a full navigation. Closing a shop moves to the back office. specs/137.\n\nCloses #277\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwCDGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6CoQAHeyihVbnGycmUZgOzFczYC9\nbIWGNFU6wLj3cRkHWZqwYIvw5IaLhKuSH9kU3fqh+vOB+k2T/bHm+qP7rq5Nga7j\nPyFvw0z7pehX7s3YdTjFPn+X/VMBpjbfUI9ST0Ya3ZaorT7uYIBV9E/MIhbhbdH6\nMcVHrPYSVROuVzEQ/7za1oFKq7mjTMt0bTdDLHzp5pEHNgKaZdV+T/s57WFQWdCF\n5r72FdwiNpc77oaNnVAxvK6m3UwoGppxOBjs+aV0DkV1rTevI6KjEBWObXbO7GN8\n6feaZpSWdIGk8QE0UXCDLEQJMa5J6UoWMFrsAWGVp8wibtSccbl6v64MVktCsxWo\ngkqxsjBGs06UHsBxCX9IsR8pKEoyTsaXqzQfZUiyEEECb78Oqcfl+vaiMPmoj5B4\np3SvTOwjAHAp1IeGQ5VGmbaKnVW42yjVu1NQ6dro0rDGbOYa2hd7fFtOtvDL2UOO\nolC+aNfkAG1+0aDlcpoz/fy9wXPzRCCYv3jX//kzAM2XA/s8kz7iFfzBkaoZJPGf\ngUCkuMKbxIiZdtymUmv/ZUKcvwmmNSKjSJxqrdNPmP4hpR9cfjXbEfIDHeGDiYlz\nk+8EP+GsedMu81gWQtvOrxIUx68lRQcy1X9bPGyjE871ifZEKfUk40xJkj6lk6/6\njj8I1gjsOV9HN8erCmXv\n=7AKR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T21:23:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKGIwMGY1MWZhMTY5NTEzNmU1MTVhMWE1NDAyZmEyMThjYTEzYWU2MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555","sha":"5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555"}],"sha":"b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/b00f51fa1695136e515a1a5402fa218ca13ae610"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:54:14Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:54:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(client): a back office for staff, with its own sign-in (#282)\n\nThe second step of ADR-003. apps/back-office (portal.localhost:5174 in development, ecommerce-back-office on :8089 in compose): staff sign in with their password and the code, a guard admits only staff, and a page greets them. Its session is its own - Identity''s host-only refresh cookie on portal.*, a different host from the storefront, because cookies ignore the port. The sign-in form and query-state messages move to packages/core, the theme to packages/ui. One Dockerfile builds either app (ARG APP); the gateway trusts the back office''s nginx; CI checks, scans and publishes the 11th image; Playwright signs a moderator in. specs/136.\n\nCloses #276\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfff8f44b5d0cc5414641b8c5f5dc0ff4907b47b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/bfff8f44b5d0cc5414641b8c5f5dc0ff4907b47b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555","verification":{"payload":"tree bfff8f44b5d0cc5414641b8c5f5dc0ff4907b47b\nparent d9c1738237ea367edd449f25248056ccb8326f3e\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790927654 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790927654 +0700\n\nfeat(client): a back office for staff, with its own sign-in (#282)\n\nThe second step of ADR-003. apps/back-office (portal.localhost:5174 in development, ecommerce-back-office on :8089 in compose): staff sign in with their password and the code, a guard admits only staff, and a page greets them. Its session is its own - Identity''s host-only refresh cookie on portal.*, a different host from the storefront, because cookies ignore the port. The sign-in form and query-state messages move to packages/core, the theme to packages/ui. One Dockerfile builds either app (ARG APP); the gateway trusts the back office''s nginx; CI checks, scans and publishes the 11th image; Playwright signs a moderator in. specs/136.\n\nCloses #276\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv2MmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJqIQAKSY4K2WWbCrqIGQo0pcDkht\nkCf1R+JpUpfhynr4B7HDRu6TTuC9+dzyLwd4G4Nd8LGL3m70pLxHGiE2/oJWSDn6\nqFfhIrAWkX1gWQkZc6MObCEB9lgeT5YveG4LgW38whPc8tym77bFGdhDqI0+Yrim\ntoINaFlLhLxH+v/fq7D/qYBEdwd2BWJGqxRClCYwSKCir2ADwCN6mROqJjhXmyZL\niAQrTNWpMDb6vYhTpfyBIXYxRjfU7Ec2gviSV36VWlwcwt99W8Wf07MDI1JOdXlt\nH5dYqaVc7fAJJGwBfZVZiHZBl4a569T1/d6tiQS3kE/aXKLoKET5mgecInKQcus8\nGCb1uEY+KnD2kEoeG7xpEEdm0ojg6qyuDttu/8rLkBIgw0RR11yQN4qKzRY/2dKt\ntz9YPUF7fv5OVuJDv+Q5Yv1WLBhfOFIISyH8EWTh0yWrMm9kFt63kaAGj4QZYMin\n/m39vX61ctaGcIchbutf4sGwGq0STlA6YaMQWHSt/oDVv3/4uxljP8SO8WjHbjnP\nYW0m4cJcJhDiKH4IoMYPKpZLEt6/oHv3hT1y6tIsSOSKgEea4vIm9JuoWmhtJzu3\ntHE9yryhg/ZnHCL3fX6RVip+d5A0axAgP7AgET8gbUofPiLC471FpouvbX7WTM3A\nr+jJfCxrXgYEImbh5V+1\n=gnbj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T07:54:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDVlMWUzOTg2MjFhMWI5ZTMwZTI5ZjhkM2MwNjhmOTIzNjQ0MTk1NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/d9c1738237ea367edd449f25248056ccb8326f3e","sha":"d9c1738237ea367edd449f25248056ccb8326f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/d9c1738237ea367edd449f25248056ccb8326f3e"}],"sha":"5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/5e1e398621a1b9e30e29f8d3c068f92364419555"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/d9c1738237ea367edd449f25248056ccb8326f3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:14:06Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T07:14:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(client): the client becomes a workspace of apps and packages (#281)\n\nclient/ is an npm workspace - apps/storefront, packages/ui (the shadcn kit and cn), packages/core (config, context, services, hooks, utils, constants, locales, test helpers). Shared code is imported as @ecommerce/core/... and @ecommerce/ui/...; @/ is an app''s own src. A layering test fails if a package imports an app. The app''s index.css names the packages with @source, without which the stylesheet halves and the build still passes. Nothing a person sees changes. ADR-003 records why the staff console leaves the shop for a back office, and why that is not a micro-frontend. specs/135.\n\nCloses #275\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c098492605af3c72396a9e98550864e7c9b0b692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/c098492605af3c72396a9e98550864e7c9b0b692"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/d9c1738237ea367edd449f25248056ccb8326f3e","verification":{"payload":"tree c098492605af3c72396a9e98550864e7c9b0b692\nparent 87c4202901d50e434662150a6c97ca89e4ed1b2e\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790925246 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790925246 +0700\n\nrefactor(client): the client becomes a workspace of apps and packages (#281)\n\nclient/ is an npm workspace - apps/storefront, packages/ui (the shadcn kit and cn), packages/core (config, context, services, hooks, utils, constants, locales, test helpers). Shared code is imported as @ecommerce/core/... and @ecommerce/ui/...; @/ is an app''s own src. A layering test fails if a package imports an app. The app''s index.css names the packages with @source, without which the stylesheet halves and the build still passes. Nothing a person sees changes. ADR-003 records why the staff console leaves the shop for a back office, and why that is not a micro-frontend. specs/135.\n\nCloses #275\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv1m+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUcAQAJnjR7dfnA7NC6AdxAHNbbgB\nEwpx0JjGep//UczpbKJed6rWZ/r1Vxz/HuHjoaQc73/Ea+72sSkR3lEUn0jfWxJd\nzcY5wi5XvytTeFMnc8xfZg9jpAF7KhqsmbhR4CbrdfNtZfOXTLVIzJtuNlQsB1hL\nK4HRop2+bThFcvHcVBdk956bi9tGPK+wxYCCc5FRG5YuSPT3NlPSC7VAeN8uNWo7\nO9VM5NCR9vn2WeIhjrLpF0uEOIOawLEK3j35uopUAOjWsZq4Y1zSkjK/bSu1hyl1\n9sz6WjCh4Z5KN+6+eooT22UzYsBTBlc/C1416HypMhBCAlnaaAAMkaX1cD53s9jw\nZ/lNlkoyXkbPTgyiMTZGNvO3IpifqahjKBWgQpKgDMsXhGSQOzQk3gTB1wbyqLnt\nU4LP8PlGFxC/IZQj1TzkC9os/cC5+qkjMLWTNzGZNdh7d+WNoMR0tk7oyDsILphm\nIx0UF/fpZTysjn1QaYlGasExajNWxC46TBfS9JF67QYk8gvAKx7XjEctBP6z7Xaw\n4lFwKhRoeHtWO0wfHMBglw2Nj7UeHf70np5UMzP2pSM7GZtr7901/G57m5HgwDBF\nGQ0SxoMZHbazxGvEVXzthfZOuTlHvl60Ha0Qsu3E27xnTPI4cWPcV8CMHoVO1+rS\ntWU/FHTW4IKrQ9jlFyBR\n=96L5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T07:14:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type