returned by shipping-options and the quote, never frozen on the order. Checkout gains a Payment card: charged once in full when placed, a refusal takes nothing, a cancellation is refunded in full, and ''no money is moved'' only while Payment''s /health names a Stub provider. specs/134.\n\nCloses #253\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9f2dffcbd795cc1f709a6d2fbe9fbc6e1bed30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/b9f2dffcbd795cc1f709a6d2fbe9fbc6e1bed30e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/7357ad760bbd955505307e3c7e5e440d62962c07","verification":{"payload":"tree b9f2dffcbd795cc1f709a6d2fbe9fbc6e1bed30e\nparent 563aa7d8ebd0e2a3d6f0f6b619f45800cb088210\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790918457 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790918457 +0700\n\nfeat: checkout says how payment works and how long delivery takes (#274)\n\nEach delivery option says how long it takes - MinDays/MaxDays in business days, both or neither, 0-60, a CHECK that names each end NOT NULL - set at /admin/delivery, returned by shipping-options and the quote, never frozen on the order. Checkout gains a Payment card: charged once in full when placed, a refusal takes nothing, a cancellation is refunded in full, and ''no money is moved'' only while Payment''s /health names a Stub provider. specs/134.\n\nCloses #253\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvz85CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5J0QAE5cRh7hFUQ8zh/szaCB9ZNH\nA9vAI+WD+wWXHRfGJLT+VHGuH27TqMFT34CGEHse/mZX4d3hgtgyH6S5cZpTbs0E\n0Gaxxs9NzepWkvyMnuBOxE0UWUQfE0kjnSaWelUb5chovD61Q0hWBwTpGKLSrs2s\nE8+10jjdz5FcH+O0vmDROe2s0zv8Gf6i6QofiNJsW+QhQMZzfWOp5Ngh+s2yQx0z\nJ4ocPUHDNcCScQKXw1DOPGzH8oMX6q/mQFk3jHX7NVQyev3u5FtyAShIdhVY7gqM\n/MzSeaMf4LAqnxjYNlGtd5IVKD2pugSJQSnSz1l4NEW48fDsSc