,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/b131bc2f5b15b9c0880da1b6d45c788c1efc4a94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T03:30:31Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T03:30:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: a seller''s home says what needs them (#271)\n\nA sale waiting to be prepared was small grey text on /shop, and questions, returns and a missing payout account were visible only on their own pages. GET /api/orders/sales takes an optional status of the seller''s own part, counted in SQL across every page; /shop opens with Needs you (sales to prepare, questions, returns, payout account) and the seller menu badges the same counts. Takings read ''Sales before commission''; the sales subtitle is corrected.\n\nCloses #247\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac8be86e3337d9b6c8fa9ae0385230bd732eaa54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/ac8be86e3337d9b6c8fa9ae0385230bd732eaa54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/b131bc2f5b15b9c0880da1b6d45c788c1efc4a94","verification":{"payload":"tree ac8be86e3337d9b6c8fa9ae0385230bd732eaa54\nparent 947a6abc61769b44475ef88b8cb1423d495ad146\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790911831 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790911831 +0700\n\nfeat: a seller''s home says what needs them (#271)\n\nA sale waiting to be prepared was small grey text on /shop, and questions, returns and a missing payout account were visible only on their own pages. GET /api/orders/sales takes an optional status of the seller''s own part, counted in SQL across every page; /shop opens with Needs