riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/fb7f7444f6f7526cb4e8bc762b2e0df6c8d635a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:49:16Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:49:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: a seller edits what they listed (#263)\n\nA seller''s product page edited only the photograph, prices and stock. Now PUT /api/products/{id} corrects the original name, description and category (an approved product goes back to review, the category included); the lookup carries the original text and each language''s own text as stored; the page edits details, each language''s text and adds variants, and reads the product signed in - a product off the shelf was a 404 on its own seller''s page.\n\nCloses #240\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fee618f53b3c6c48c41e7828421a254331b0760a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/fee618f53b3c6c48c41e7828421a254331b0760a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/fb7f7444f6f7526cb4e8bc762b2e0df6c8d635a9","verification":{"payload":"tree fee618f53b3c6c48c41e7828421a254331b0760a\nparent 7af91b9e4cf941ec45d616bc30f5182c12cd6061\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790848156 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790848156 +0700\n\nfeat: a seller edits what they listed (#263)\n\nA seller''s product page edited only the photograph, prices and stock. Now PUT /api/products/{id} corrects the original name, description and category (an approved product goes back to review, the category included); the look