g row, Min-Max on one row and a loading tint on images; the first product is at 807px and the page 2,626px. A Playwright test at 390px holds it.\n\nCloses #245\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39d6ab03ee25bb3f93cc2548b365d8025603e30f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/39d6ab03ee25bb3f93cc2548b365d8025603e30f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/e3a9b434c9ffbb5a9578d404227703e0e4b03f25","verification":{"payload":"tree 39d6ab03ee25bb3f93cc2548b365d8025603e30f\nparent 7621cd7303a1175348eb114bc6de39023d46695a\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790845558 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790845558 +0700\n\nfix(client): the catalogue on a phone (#261)\n\nAt 390px the catalogue was one product per row - 6,453px for twelve - with the first product 1,355px down. Now two to a row, a compact hero without the featured photo, categories in one scrolling row, Min-Max on one row and a loading tint on images; the first product is at 807px and the page 2,626px. A Playwright test at 390px holds it.\n\nCloses #245\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqviJ2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYywQAK7/pP7UbRoj2yjz8e7KslNx\nF0Nd9mPGFccekO/+tTHYu6fK/UNfip50CM8sdalUmO4MwXDCJvBT3kaKnAi2x753\n4er/7eQz8vkTx9Yy3KHXClPzVR3Xt8DFoWC6u7yJimUoXrNXFp6gM8Ioy6lxG0Fg\nFbBLx6Xxh0gvNjxdMpc3YiwHeF/Qu+QGypB5DIUebpxDb4Y7kvEJo+n4OIDC0Sz3\no7UFbsjJjQQUS9g7CK0jRuN2k7tEpHrL1IYYgAjIEnuVofmCQ9ltr8m2jdlyMC3L\n65+uL8Bmv8QKBcrhAM6ys5t6lMwj1ZHZt34MpgT4QVKJcIBlNBB1mHtm8IJ73ws8\n5wCtRnomBjIvfa1wxsjDoanA9P3DJQ/tRogY9qinD3ttPl9ez6W7zs6jXGX34ULN\nJCuWxRj4L/mvCGRiJDZO9tY9KUmMZhqCLXX36iJhSOhnGZp9tuedJ3DfY5t2AOl6\nuhiCFQsPedvgP9BaC5kXq8141N8yhiu3A116H+i3bsD9MmGXw9rXLKykiChrp5D+\nTZ6CZbq7qs06dAT1w5bCj+B1l4VbQQxvqTeiKs4g9hSg7d2ngFLKrVz5vBq8Poym\n8JJ7