r":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:10:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(client): the cart empties on screen when the order is paid (#258)\n\nStraight after paying, the header still counted the camera just bought: Cart empties on OrderCompletedEvent, and the client never re-read it once the order settled. useOrder now re-reads the cart when an order it saw settling settles, and once more 2 s later for Cart''s consumer. A hook test and the browser flows hold it.\n\nCloses #242\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"635abbe20bed24ac6f449b72c2706ab234bb0a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/635abbe20bed24ac6f449b72c2706ab234bb0a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/1cc4d39d02981299c17d6522915a56b41bc22cc9","verification":{"payload":"tree 635abbe20bed24ac6f449b72c2706ab234bb0a05\nparent a233ffc61266f86085d9668cec1a94ef51203b15\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790842237 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790842237 +0700\n\nfix(client): the cart empties on screen when the order is paid (#258)\n\nStraight after paying, the header still counted the camera just bought: Cart empties on OrderCompletedEvent, and the client never re-read it once the order settled. useOrder now re-reads the cart when an order it saw settling settles, and once more 2 s later for Cart''s consumer. A hook test and the browser flows hold it.\n\nCloses #242\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvhV9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAagAQABYISwMoIGEnXePvyeCgBd2S\nAYaYz5kf6GQjzIyMEOVmBxWqsrGRbShJErd+ith9rD3dqCmkNYliwmkDMdSr9efa\nZt4Gnfh0tVeQhIqU7/rcxPE0VDhg6Q4CgsL0JWmw8wrZbWMdg+UPfYBVp2baR18a\nHbhwoC8iOzjZCetaZMW+5vmb4VrrubK8h9CbCGQfHpiNyWytTXtCjzoTHYz/hrFm\n+AJ4sGZGx/ez3NL5njrMIAfYdQKb/SuegHimKE7gOhFEcVx