-dotnet-practice/commit/157992d413419ca18698832bc4a1c4a3a2b25173","sha":"157992d413419ca18698832bc4a1c4a3a2b25173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/157992d413419ca18698832bc4a1c4a3a2b25173"}],"sha":"39af0e9f600e676b7ce4d30f6c286c35ab8ac2e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/39af0e9f600e676b7ce4d30f6c286c35ab8ac2e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/157992d413419ca18698832bc4a1c4a3a2b25173/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:09:37Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:09:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: administrators are told when an email fails for good (#235)\n\nCloses #222. After each dispatch sweep, in its transaction, one guarded statement marks the failed emails no notice has counted (outgoing_emails.FailureAlertedAt) - none within an hour of the last notice - and each administrator gets one in-app EmailsFailed digest with the count, linking to the email log. Each failure is counted once, also by two sweeps at once; a retry clears the mark. The Overview shows the failed count.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0015a80748e79d9d0f833fa37a8979116de6c78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/e0015a80748e79d9d0f833fa37a8979116de6c78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/157992d413419ca18698832bc4a1c4a3a2b25173","verification":{"payload":"tree e0015a80748e79d9d0f833fa37a8979116de6c78\nparent b7e1e8977e1609bd329ac3e78117b6fa744c63ba\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790802577 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790802577 +0700\n\nfeat: administrators are told when an email fails for good (#235)\n\nCloses #222. After each dispatch sweep, in its transaction, one guarded statement marks the failed emails no notice has counted (outgoing_emails.FailureAlertedAt) - none within an hour of the last notice - and each administrator gets one in-app EmailsFailed digest with the count, linking to the email log. Each failure is counted once, also by two sweeps at once; a retry clears the mark. The Overview shows the failed count.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvXqRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEH0QAAdlzXUXtXnQmiPJfSV0AYQA\nhPkiwal3tDEkkzaADC69qx+OxRJppvKwrlhUOxlz6WP5OVEktF7V+rwoeGzGoNqJ\nVjY2hYaG/EqwUT3+Bk/ujrhMaq1LxzGcY/8VBQLRnPzZhB149NQO3sujgwhoJTwf\nBJcCXRMHg4w5563Trz1ZVPFyQnS85tqkHBFnWeNR5WR+X82nbAP4dwsJi6klv8S+\na/8qqrJFiiIDE+ezz85MApRFwEF+INFmdiKjO2YcDf1PC+oOzrcOtPg6Bb5YqaKy\n748qLEOt00pNnC66tyhgihxXRtVRX6kJ9aa60eTUzGUxPXJ2qDCrndvIMNechOkf\nutVnPPA45sHJgQNl3v5vw8KwqeBg+M