net-practice/commits/157992d413419ca18698832bc4a1c4a3a2b25173"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/b7e1e8977e1609bd329ac3e78117b6fa744c63ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:47:51Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:47:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: shoppers see the vouchers they could use (#234)\n\nCloses #220. vouchers.IsPublic - false for every voucher from before and by default, set by its owner on create or edit. Anonymous GET /api/vouchers/public lists the public, live, not-used-up vouchers priced in the request''s currency for the platform and named shops (and one product), at most 12, ending soonest first, never with a limit or a count. The shop page and product pages list them with Copy code; checkout lists the platform''s and the cart''s shops'' and Use tries the code like typing it. Quote and order lines carry sellerId.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be3fd79d99672691805b5d18d0e26d0fd051d148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/be3fd79d99672691805b5d18d0e26d0fd051d148"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/b7e1e8977e1609bd329ac3e78117b6fa744c63ba","verification":{"payload":"tree be3fd79d99672691805b5d18d0e26d0fd051d148\nparent 80ee3491b758feb8d39e315a77da41a7a909c1e7\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790801271 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790801271 +0700\n\nfeat: shoppers see the vouchers they could use (#234)\n\nCloses #220. vouchers.IsPublic - false for every voucher from before and by default, set by its owner on create or edit. Anonymous GET /api/vouchers/public lists the public, live, not-used-up vouchers priced in the request''s currency for the platform and named shops (and one product), at most 12, ending soonest first, never with a limit or a count. The shop page and product pages list them with Copy code; checkout lists the platform''s and the cart''s shops'' and Use tries the code like typing it. Quote and order lines carry sellerId.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvXV3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY14QALIni+h/eBpmgqXXJ3zs7ijf\naVp5qO7phBdy1d1qsf2qEN6oO6v2HQboWxPC1rw7w5iQTkeJU3nc34S7lsZt7vyh\nDPswOft5YSugCJ4eBYNFPjYf77cuBVAAdfj8lpZuT/KJvDpAkai6vo7d0H9sp4yy\ncpVuVsGHsWPEEYJM7DIQTQOTqDa5w3LW8tDytEU0QtETAgA4Ujz8fsKDvvRyhCR2\n3UAr9bt28rNqmRhBJMhbMUlTVK25pKRGVYZs7mo92DqKBishgLo5EDhT/OjbKoWZ\nTpku45qaZrOrEZD2YeESGxK/ikNMqz1iplObyoOUKy0FpxPzKPUeRwBKuHIao9dy\n+6Z2uqvxxlvU/nkGahfrz0td9BXZyxM3nGaSrgaXKMARka5vN5f0lMZAT6Qlnzj3\nv4+HMO/Tb/1R+riPvgVrsxynIR3Yr8nunDpUPxismxU6XE8ciVfPPk6o8s0qs8jW\nNZcBSmNREKq9wnL1Mgnur25S4MeFigi4Ms0XyeibSTNe6QXgA2aLY7T