"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/1c2834ecb991d63cd1c8694e91f25857b91f2972/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:09:12Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:09:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: a person deletes their account (#232)\n\nCloses #217. DELETE /api/auth/me with the password: refused for staff, on a wrong password (counted toward the sign-in pause) and while business is open - Identity asks Order live over gRPC (AccountStanding, Order''s first gRPC service, the token forwarded) - and 503 when Order cannot say. Identity then empties the user row (placeholder email, users.DeletedAt), deletes everything else it holds, and publishes AccountDeleted and AccessTokensRevoked; Catalog, Order, Cart and Activity erase or anonymise their rows as each personal-data inventory declares its Kept sections, keeping the books without a name, email, phone or address. The storefront''s account page deletes; reviews and questions left behind read ''a former customer''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17f6d495a866ebf578f89f3854e63886ae2d2fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/17f6d495a866ebf578f89f38