github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/1780a70fb8c21578a9a89697467b50a15a4f4711/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:11:36Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:11:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: a person downloads the data the shop holds about them (#231)\n\nPart of #217. \"Download my data\" on /account: six services each answer for their own database from the token (/api/auth/me/data, /api/products/my-data, /api/orders/my-data, /api/cart/my-data, /api/payments/my-data, /api/notifications/my-data), and the storefront composes one JSON file, marking a service that did not answer. Every table of every model is declared exported, withheld with a reason, or not personal, and a test per service holds the list to the EF model. Readers project fields by name: no secret, staff identity or audit snapshot leaves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17802c0c7d110ce6833fe5d652dfefb414577a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerc