 authenticator app works (TOTP)\n\nThe shared secret in the QR code, the HMAC over the 30-second window, the check the server does without asking\nthe app, and the traps - replay, clock drift, guessing, encrypting the secret. A worked example from RFC 6238''s\ntest vectors. Ahead of #218, which fills in how this project uses it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"efacb9014eb1080eea102dabce37c888fb622d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/efacb9014eb1080eea102dabce37c888fb622d35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/fcd9e036c56d2747676a8c4fb4eb74c2cf22d7a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/fcd9e036c56d2747676a8c4fb4eb74c2cf22d7a2","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKGZjZDllMDM2YzU2ZDI3NDc2NzZhOGM0ZmI0ZWI3NG