503ce4e456db9351999ba6d023ff3e4f6095b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/8a3503ce4e456db9351999ba6d023ff3e4f6095b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/85e6bd0cb28d3a5c0e422b83eaa87765abd17641/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:01:50Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:01:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: a seller''s list of the returns of their parcels (#228)\n\nCloses #215 - specs/108.\n\nGET /api/orders/sales/returns (Seller) lists the returns of the caller''s own parcels by state, oldest waiting first,\nfiltered on parcel_returns.SellerId - never another seller''s or the shop''s. Each row of the seller''s sales carries the\nstate of the return of their own parcel. The storefront: /shop/returns with a tab per state, opening on the ones to\nanswer, and a badge on /shop/sales. No schema change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5544082bdb749c9842a760efe886dfb2ea47752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/c5544082bdb749c9842a760efe886dfb2ea47752"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/85e6bd0cb28d3a5c0e422b83eaa87765abd17641","verification":{"payload":"tree c5544082bdb749c9842a760efe886dfb2ea47752\nparent 7517539a2c668c62a077dd3226c199f85e7e6023\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790510510 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790510510 +0700\n\nfeat: a seller''s list of the returns of their parcels (#228)\n\nCloses #215 - specs/108.\n\nGET /api/orders/sales/returns (Seller) lists the returns of the caller''s own parcels by state, oldest waiting first,\nfiltered on parcel_returns.SellerId - never another seller''s or the shop''s. Each row of the seller''s sales carries the\nstate of the return of their own parcel. The storefront: /shop/returns with a tab per state, opening on the ones to\nanswer, and a badge on /shop/sales. No schema change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquQWuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWYQQAECmdEGuDJ7D1yvPHPg9BzLH\nsq5xsBXcwu6nfr5ancr2G3ZotMn7HuWSuXBNV/0x/gdI1GT9WhraWY8EL3Tz1Z4O\nrsDBZIffOl+htzi5+IncYROvVQaiOx/pR5zcHkKqu5sXaFZavCHn+Yq5FyU74kcO\nvvJ7AGTRfhaQI5bDPLcbXYoMOhyY5oZ6yEncrs7nogCsnCpeVn2NyI45X3BXITuw\nzYQ2zvLm7H/kKpBqmq2ZqFxY/nehuLi0I1Dxzz2jhAznnL8pRU+dSWDTI+yqBJdA\nqZGAlIgRAZMNCFEqe7CjRhyXTADC0hDkyKkTVnxhnilI0pBy1eRlS62AOQw6Hs4d\nuUifn+bIObnhfy2RPmaWzUxFuieJj2jCjYFplOqmCxz1ECTAJJjLU1u2q5UKTmbG\n/42KYwLAmiQgVWSDggXEM4dIS/burVcbBBiUDEhtuBNieXOzejqjY5j7GcXlG4dc\n2hHUiqcfXPgiZE/19fxup8pd3zcz6Sk1W/XZLs+Tl5U5K7i6oFLYm0rRGkf2SFjl\n5MxOGOFpzBO402bwdTCv4Iz8FmaboXrOJnGaD9Mp4OVA1LT5li/KfY1QejrS/Goh\nAc9