tps://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7517539a2c668c62a077dd3226c199f85e7e6023/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:45:09Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:45:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: a seller pauses their shop, and staff close one (#227)\n\nCloses #214 - specs/107.\n\nA seller pauses their shop from /shop and reopens it; staff close one with a reason the seller reads, without\ntouching the account, and only staff reopen it (Closed shops tab of /admin/shops). Catalog''s sellers row holds\nPausedAt and ClosedAt; products.SellerSuspended now means the shop is not open and one statement writes it from\nban, pause and closure, so lifting one never reopens a shop another keeps shut. Approval takes the shop''s state.\nShopClosed and ShopReopened notices; every move audited. Migration AddShopPauseAndClosure only adds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20db788e73d597ad75d4c9576580468fa1a1330f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/20db788e73d597ad75d4c9576580468fa1a1330f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/7517539a2c668c62a077dd3226c199f85e7e6023","verification":{"payload":"tree 20db788e73d597ad75d4c9576580468fa1a1330f\nparent ae6c1e9a37139469aafbc5106452d35eb119bab2\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790509509 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790509509 +0700\n\nfeat: a seller pauses their shop, and staff close one (#227)\n\nCloses #214 - specs/107.\n\nA seller pauses their shop from /shop and reopens it; staff close one with a reason the seller reads, without\ntouching the account, and only staff reopen it (Closed shops tab of /admin/shops). Catalog''s sellers row holds\nPausedAt and ClosedAt; products.SellerSuspended now means the shop is not open and one statement writes it from\nban, pause and closure, so lifting one never reopens a shop another keeps shut. Approval takes the shop''s state.\nShopClosed and ShopReopened notices; every move audited. Migration AddShopPauseAndClosure only adds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquQHFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgokQADSravEpwQmqc6kmHxAFHlw2\nKQdsBZO4lsHFeX9Rm90EQGdLk1ju+aVWSxom+7V8qnvT5ZUDNrrGVW+zLSv38tke\nCPoEYZqtm+g7lLqbTrMPzm0Ww2RRypvMhY1iEOBV6EbI9/tJA9Omoj95TDdQMw1N\nThRmGrmUUkxPqigjCQN7BC04zzJ6kqjEsn9XhYxcub8E0eupyTew0PCSEiDBHqEP\npaziakdluLXgnxMacGjOgsalrl/XWOL0CuA05AAnrZIZdJfG7jRFbt1e55ke0bLT\nfN15LWnitwzjcZUE08nSR/9XMyuBXamF4teuLRI5i4E2yxmx786yOXRGH786Y9fD\n1LXNBzPPzrk8FuFUhXgR4/zM9wFnOw1Z7T1Ts3IE3w9/wcCqWCvJ1I8wOtT2soH+\nK1eIw850Cjp2vQ0dYm8VLjvWNObdUR6zlLhflwoKkWZLYNp5YQQv3viYxjWv+zz/\niJR7Sd4pAw1azggLV+7arRcFcARtflAxqlcvcIfufmvQvJudQla4usdLEXeSvYMU\n3pT3Knq1tdg0JGgqM+Y8aoDi/sltHRByImlAxioaqnVQoWf/xjXkrdMnZ9Ug9nV+\nehXtXoT02mLC/eGqVfq95TXJEZq7P1zjId8F9+ZcC5tB70PfTsVGHYBqiMC/n9Fq\nMxjn6Uk+DduyaL8erAvb\n=6UI1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T11:45:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/7517539a2c668c62a077dd3226c199f85e7e6023","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDc1MTc1MzlhMmM2NjhjNjJhMDc3ZGQzMjI2YzE5OWY4NWU3ZTYwMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/ae6c1e9a37139469aafbc5106452d35eb119bab2","sha":"ae6c1e9a37139469aafbc5106452d35eb119bab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/ae6c1e9a37139469aafbc5106452d35eb119bab2"}],"sha":"7517539a2c668c62a077dd3226c199f85e7e6023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7517539a2c668c62a077dd3226c199f85e7e6023"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/ae6c1e9a37139469aafbc5106452d35eb119bab2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:40:13Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:40:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: sellers say where their payouts go (#226)\n\nCloses #213 - specs/106.\n\nA seller gives one payout account in Identity (seller_payout_accounts): read back masked, audited and emailed\n(PayoutAccountChanged) with the last four digits only. Administrators read the whole numbers at\nGET /api/sellers/payout-accounts. Recording a payout asks Identity over Admin-only gRPC (PayoutAccounts) before the\nclaim, refuses with 409 when there is no account, and freezes bank, holder and last four on the payout.\nThe storefront shows the account on /shop/payouts and beside what is due on /admin/payouts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5910385363c0f6a71a571967e187a083a6dffb29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/5910385363c0f6a71a571967e187a083a6dffb29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/ae6c1e9a37139469aafbc5106452d35eb119bab2","verification":{"payload":"tree 5910385363c0f6a71a571967e187a083a6dffb29\nparent 51d6e5ed3973980c2e9463276a064263b2b5660a\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790505613 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790505613 +0700\n\nfeat: sellers say where their payouts go (#226)\n\nCloses #213 - specs/106.\n\nA seller gives one payout account in Identity (seller_payout_accounts): read back masked, audited and emailed\n(PayoutAccountChanged) with the last four digits only. Administrators read the whole numbers at\nGET /api/sellers/payout-accounts. Recording a payout asks Identity over Admin-only gRPC (PayoutAccounts) before the\nclaim, refuses with 409 when there is no account, and freezes bank, holder and last four on the payout.\nThe storefront shows the account on /shop/payouts and beside what is due on /admin/payouts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquPKNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAokQAFv1nNCAaE2sF6UGtgiVRLiF\nmzTM7TXHbt33vFDNg14Ki+++GGXT4IjYPDD7G/CRcNlp2kcjxHekdlhvy1H/kAte\n+zUNJMJJ3Vg/r7Wzn9MjY8//a75PvfXFDkbWalYNGxPPKAMLYEDEWC4JpIvPO6Pl\nQzWNGLC9D8980t3N/zU62aR6uWY/XsRa8OzQA3n8fI0gDcxeQhpGT43lIK51JKKl\nTVEXACzRzL6W53gxHvqsSnKmZ9w/1IfS0Q6LV5dzkLvU3esM8by4zqkktLKthBCu\nwcgonCTZBIjx/+EeMA5gq1/E1HC2j0T2iXOuHPBSQC1OQQaG6b4sWLjLf1IvGomg\nqYZI8QAhjZfb2HJAjcSzByalmrHcG2QUKveisTR3R3pPeUYV6pHFALjqOSDh4GYJ\ncx2mwaItNxYl32ONv0ix9j/DaGLrk5qrgN7ZYa4Pv2CaIR+w9o/khaoCRAQUyG2R\n9PWWnGkc1pdDP0CYHhoXmbD+01YpFlRd1K0aR+TTmco7UyTaPfI3dH1j50UOaWuE\nAGsRrTxAKABeOFhGitLIAMrNNU/WKWeZ5Mesi3d32VYDa6lqmaQq0JwLesJuaYSN\nuxe9NI4g5PnI5qF415H/ZgP2CewleBKo2l/OCeSOTLDjljplooveGJbbRGJbx0PC\nUmjCzso0q4PpIwep6741\n=0iq2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T10:40:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata