":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/51d6e5ed3973980c2e9463276a064263b2b5660a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:01:07Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:01:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(order): a mistyped tracking reference can be corrected (#225)\n\nA mistyped tracking reference is corrected while the parcel is on its way (specs/105, closes #212).\n\n- PUT /api/orders/sales/{id}/tracking (Seller) and /fulfilment/{id}/tracking (Admin, the shop''s part): shipped, not delivered, not cancelled; under the order''s row lock; the order''s summary rewritten\n- ShippedAt never moves, so automatic delivery and the return window still count from when the parcel left\n- Every correction audited with both references and the buyer told (TrackingCorrected); the same reference is a no-op\n- Storefront: a Correct dialog on the sale and admin order pages; the ship hint no longer says a reference cannot be changed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"615e3e7fbc1ba655a10e01d126b0c7ddce8639f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/615e3e7fbc1ba655a10e01d126b0c7ddce8639f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/r