wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/a1bfb9c0a41784418ddf7b5fcb4b5b01c5967235/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:16:55Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T08:16:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(order): a seller cancels the part of an order they cannot fulfil (#224)\n\nA seller cancels the part of an order they cannot fulfil, and staff the shop''s own part, before it ships and with a reason the buyer reads (specs/104, closes #211).\n\n- Order: the part gets cancellation columns under the order''s row lock; while other parts remain OrderPartCancelledEvent is staged, that seller''s voucher given back, the buyer told; the last part cancels the order whole\n- Every reader of parts skips a cancelled one: the summary, moves, cancel-all, earnings, insights\n- Inventory RestockCancelledPartConsumer returns the part''s reservations (held released, confirmed back on hand)\n- Payment RefundCancelledPartConsumer refunds goods less discounts plus tax once per part; the whole refund is what is left; the whole-refund lookups skip part refunds\n- Storefront: cancel with a reason on the sale and admin order pages; the cancelled part on the buyer''s order\n- Live check: 20,350,000 + 6,072,000 refunded = the 26,422,000 charged, every unit back\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83228617ec2e27b6b3b782772de37ccfd0418474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/83228617ec2e27b6b3b782772de37ccfd0418474"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/a1bfb9c0a41784418ddf7b5fcb4b5b01c5967235","verification":{"payload":"tree 83228617ec2e27b6b3b782772de37ccfd0418474\nparent 8100b90edc0290ed9df18aefc7920568a535b163\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790497015 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790497015 +0700\n\nfeat(order): a seller cancels the part of an order they cannot fulfil (#224)\n\nA seller cancels the part of an order they cannot fulfil, and staff the shop''s own part, before it ships and with a reason the buyer reads (specs/104, closes #211).\n\n- Order: the part gets cancellation columns under the order''s row lock; while other parts remain OrderPartCancelledEvent is staged, that seller''s voucher given back, the buyer told; the last part cancels the order whole\n- Every reader of parts skips a cancelled one: the summary, moves, cancel-all, earnings, insights\n- Inventory RestockCancelledPartConsumer returns the part''s reservations (held released, confirmed back on hand)\n- Payment RefundCancelledPartConsumer refunds goods less discounts plus tax once per part; the whole refund is what is left; the whole-refund lookups skip part refunds\n- Storefront: cancel with a reason on the sale and admin order pages; the cancelled part on the buyer''s order\n- Live check: 20,350,000 + 6,072,000 refunded = the 26,422,000 charged, every unit back\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquND3CRC