 of failing the first checkout with a 500 (specs/103, closes #210).\n\n- Order''s required settings are resolved in one list, RequiredSettings.Check (shipping options, tax rates, and now the commission rate), which Program.cs calls after Build()\n- RequiredSettingsTests run the check over the real AddInfrastructure registration: red before the fix (5 of 7), green after\n- The known limit leaves docs/features/marketplace.md; CLAUDE.md, backlog and timeline updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa520288e252f3b3c6936e7bd39a50320f1e8417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/fa520288e252f3b3c6936e7bd39a50320f1e8417"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/8100b90edc0290ed9df18aefc7920568a535b163","verification":{"payload":"tree fa520288e252f3b3c6936e7bd39a50320f1e8417\nparent a8775847ffbef37b6d4e78443115b6e189045e6b\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790494391 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790494391 +0700\n\nfix(order): a missing commission rate stops Order at startup (#223)\n\nA missing or impossible Marketplace:CommissionRate stops Order at startup instead of failing the first checkout with a 500 (specs/103, closes #210).\n\n- Order''s required settings are resolved in one list, RequiredSettings.Check (shipping options, tax rates, and now the commission rate), which Program.cs calls after Build()\n- RequiredSettingsTests run the check over the real AddInfrastructure registration: red before the fix (5 of 7), green after\n- The known limit leaves docs/features/marketplace.md; CLAUDE.md, backlog and timeline updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquMa3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKCMQAGJ4imwEqIp3h8IurlojqrXt\nTUIwmvDv9ti9YavLU1ciVciMS/CjYzhbineKq/08F0PPBBZDb3yNF00nN6QxVZia\n+nbfQS