aru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/aa3a0b58ff1bfb0d22b80286d489e32b4f675073/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T05:41:15Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T05:41:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(inventory): a seller is told when a variant runs low (#209)\n\nA seller is told when a sale takes one of their variants below its low-stock line (specs/102, closes #200).\n\n- Inventory: stock_items.LowStockThreshold (null = Inventory:LowStock:DefaultThreshold, 5; 0 = never), refused at startup when unusable\n- The reservation judges the crossing from before and after under its own FOR UPDATE rows - no stored flag - and stages StockRanLowEvent with it\n- PUT /api/stock/{variantId}/low-stock-threshold (Seller, Admin), same live ownership check and 404 as setting stock, audited\n- Catalog StockRanLowConsumer tells the seller (StockRunningLow: product and options, left); nobody for the shop''s own goods\n- Storefront: a Warn me below field beside the stock count; notice words in en and vi\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record; 101 ticked as #208\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de8a0e454a58dfabe165e755cc1c951c38326594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/de8a0e454a58dfabe165e755cc1c951c38326594"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/aa3a0b58ff1bfb0d22b80286d489e32b4f675073","verification":{"payload":"tree de8a0e454a58dfabe165e755cc1c951c38326594\nparent 8bb29023aef178a47d2f0048dfed65550e8a4a72\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790487675 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790487675 +0700\n\nfeat(inventory): a seller is told when a variant runs low (#209)\n\nA seller is told when a sale takes one of their variants below its low-stock line (specs/102, closes #200).\n\n- Inventory: stock_items.LowStockThreshold (null = Inventory:LowStock:DefaultThreshold, 5; 0 = never), refused at startup when unusable\n- The reservation judges the crossing from before and after under its own FOR UPDATE rows - no stored flag - and stages StockRanLowEvent with it\n- PUT /api/stock/{variantId}/low-stock-threshold (Seller, Admin), same live ownership check and 404 as setting stock, audited\n- Catalog StockRanLowConsumer tells the seller (StockRunningLow: product and options, left); nobody for the shop''s own goods\n- Storefront: a Warn me below field beside the stock count; notice words in en and vi\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record; 101 ticked as #208\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquKx7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAW6gQAGN8VgMqKI7pofP21unI0Kzv\n09x38d6sXQ3iAPgkJshVPsMjVgH612O6ZL3HvkMExRLFhXTrAt29r5AQjh09trkR\n7ibEwa28CnOuZCqOBSUoSHwhqjEGZiW6PUYmbuirWcXGOMaRs4KhdTc0KrI2AIry\nBFm+MxJL8nBjxKUpeoXDDS0GCcb/Ll1tFhK7MTKI/o3WTA984LaIRNM+s5RodFyz\nghpj6iUiNIYW1tBwY1pTqDOfS5qFQZiV4c+gp0ODdvrVrXc8G06FN2i8mkEetQe5\n3OvW5cgQSM+Wt/zK42Bz1ZAaVZZP+D+8MtEF4oS05IMcsB+mJI72/a7oU4MfhK24\nwwDjImWF3coXDrrmd0JmlMpEJlgnwu2n5Le34JXiUA0soluVO61WE0biwNucXXIA\npJkQkNQZZox+B4SOW7HKjlv9tE12h0UTZhO6ghCAzMjChXja66pBvx3LYPd5AEb3\nh/hEDh4n3UMlDPkrf3TCzuXnOwHvijfEtSC9+Nb3XOstirP6k3CkceKa5JocKXmZ\n3xXvprF/g338Ynr6vo+5/Mq0ks+gfOwOALMEWq2BFsJDm8am2t1ZKNzc57