rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/8bb29023aef178a47d2f0048dfed65550e8a4a72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T05:11:36Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T05:11:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): shoppers report a review, a question or a product (#208)\n\nShoppers report a review, a question or a product, and staff work through what was reported (specs/101, closes #199).\n\n- Catalog: content_reports, one open report per person per thing (partial unique index, ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING)\n- POST /api/reports (signed in): only what a shopper can see can be reported, never one''s own\n- GET /api/reports (Staff): what is open, per thing, most reported first\n- Hiding a review, a question or an answer, or taking a product down, closes that thing''s open reports in the same transaction and tells each reporter (ReportActioned); the notice never names the moderator\n- POST /api/reports/{type}/{id}/dismiss (Staff) closes them untouched, audited, and tells each reporter (ReportDismissed)\n- No auto-hide: a person always decides (research)\n- Gateway /api/reports; storefront report button and /admin/reports; Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"148e47d587eb95a1e8d27fbcf4bcf36f0a842801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/148e47d587eb95a1e8d27fbcf4bcf36f0a842801"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/8bb29023aef178a47d2f0048dfed65550e8a4a72","verification":{"payload":"tree 148e47d587eb95a1e8d27fbcf4bcf36f0a842801\nparent 9022ab1bfeea16200d38238adf7c6c7a97bccf3e\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790485896 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790485896 +0700\n\nfeat(catalog): shoppers report a review, a question or a product (#208)\n\nShoppers report a review, a question or a product, and staff work through what was reported (specs/101, closes #199).\n\n- Catalog: content_reports, one open report per person per thing (partial unique index, ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING)\n- POST /api/reports (signed in): only what a shopper can see can be reported, never one''s own\n- GET /api/reports (Staff): what is open, per thing, most reported first\n- Hiding a review, a question or an answer, or taking a product down, closes that thing''s open reports in the same transaction and tells each reporter (ReportActioned); the notice never names the moderator\n- POST /api/reports/{type}/{id}/dismiss (Staff) closes them untouched, audited, and tells each reporter (ReportDismissed)\n- No auto-hide: a person always decides (research)\n- Gateway /api/reports; storefront report button and /admin/reports; Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquKWICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABTM