 sees what staff decided about that person before, and why.\n\n- AuditEntryRecorded gains an optional AboutUserId. AuditTrail fills it from a User subject, and content decisions name the author or seller.\n- Activity stores audit_entries.AboutUserId, backfilled for User subjects, and serves GET /api/audit/people/{userId} (Staff). It returns Moderation entries only, with reasons and without snapshots.\n- /admin/users shows the latest decisions in the lock and ban dialog, and the full history from each person''s menu.\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb7cbf5cba19df8f06ed770f3e4b4a4c3d51835e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/fb7cbf5cba19df8f06ed770f3e4b4a4c3d51835e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/9022ab1bfeea16200d38238adf7c6c7a97bccf3e","verification":{"payload":"tree fb7cbf5cba19df8f06ed770f3e4b4a4c3d51835e\nparent 7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790483714 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790483714 +0700\n\nfeat(activity): staff see a person''s moderation history (#207)\n\nStaff see a person''s moderation history (specs/100, closes #198). A moderator deciding a lock or ban sees what staff decided about that person before, and why.\n\n- AuditEntryRecorded gains an optional AboutUserId. AuditTrail fills it from a User subject, and content decisions name the author or seller.\n- Activity stores audit_entries.AboutUserId, backfilled for User subjects, and serves GET /api/audit/people/{userId} (Staff). It returns Moderation entries only, with reasons and without snapshots.\n- /admin/users shows the latest decisions in the lock and ban dialog, and the full history from each person''s menu.\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Clau