a97bccf3e","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDkwMjJhYjFiZmVlYTE2MjAwZDM4MjM4YWRmN2M2YzdhOTdiY2NmM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b","sha":"7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b"}],"sha":"9022ab1bfeea16200d38238adf7c6c7a97bccf3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/9022ab1bfeea16200d38238adf7c6c7a97bccf3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:54:33Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:54:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): a shop has a page (#206)\n\nA shop has a page (specs/099, closes #197). The shop name on a product page links to /shops/:sellerId, which shows the shop''s name, the seller''s own description and everything it has on the shelf.\n\n- Identity: seller_profiles.Description (500 max), PUT /api/sellers/me/description, and SellerDescribedEvent staged with the save\n- Catalog: sellers.Description with its own DescriptionObservedAt guard, GET /api/shops/{sellerId} (404 for unknown, unnamed or suspended), and ?sellerId= on the public listing\n- Gateway: /api/shops route\n- Storefront: the shop page, the product page link, and a description dialog beside the rename\n- Identity tests drain the email dispatcher before asserting on one email; a single pass sends only the oldest 50\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f61c4ac53dc389bfc769ceab4d22678a63a7134b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/f61c4ac53dc389bfc769ceab4d22678a63a7134b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b","verification":{"payload":"tree f61c4ac53dc389bfc769ceab4d22678a63a7134b\nparent 7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790474073 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790474073 +0700\n\nfeat(catalog): a shop has a page (#206)\n\nA shop has a page (specs/099, closes #197). The shop name on a product page links to /shops/:sellerId, which shows the shop''s name, the seller''s own description and everything it has on the shelf.\n\n- Identity: seller_profiles.Description (500 max), PUT /api/sellers/me/description, and SellerDescribedEvent staged with the save\n- Catalog: sellers.Description with its own DescriptionObservedAt guard, GET /api/shops/{sellerId} (404 for unknown, unnamed or suspended), and ?sellerId= on the public listing\n- Gateway: /api/shops route\n- Storefront: the shop page, the product page link, and a description dialog beside the rename\n- Identity tests drain the email dispatcher before asserting on one email; a single pass sends only the oldest 50\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquHdZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQmkQAAJ3tmDnhbre22yyZ+ymXpdm\njP9d+hbU7Mo552devmqEKawdotVVoedLeCOHxvNKhNX1wcxMlsLG75LHVMx6pR5e\nH2Wp7tHG4PVaCuh5VpuA4P6FGvzrFs7vzS1lCimJYgXth6MPaYZnFzMEkTHUBIJm\nj/ECzL5FKJfCpP8JWpzIb/Z4zfNCGrtmqqPp7wbI8t8pZc3m8ZptYZsbP5r1CwsT\nL+1sN+BX0V6hNOn02P+B4Ugu7DSK/F3Su0eQ+OYDyLasxrtlczU0NfOey37TAq6H\n1vdD6uNHxvafINjW7zPR1pNT6z4/1BXnn3fXgPboyzgqa+OvF7QVXi7kpceFjYsX\nt20GGJII7UFWtVCN72DPYfp8aiea0GjN6c5EG9HaXpd6AFZ/AJNhDyvIp06Uspd4\nia9bL7y4942f8Jzamzz+bhayVLe5ksWdinT1M+3YRnwcos/UjaNPJaenyhvc09MN\n6juCRNkYabve802RGFiXRotEU1f4HeNPnx5607LGSNmrjJhcKQEtIEceoUvkAu2r\nnifx1IdkM27YU9vhk+LqGQeG2SgeWgusXu6qxxO9BIYDfZpXblu9FjE9BqlN2dyw\nIzf77z69BZ8TL3eSLlxsU3NsY3gQtdJXXXAqE1bwRuwIG0xFKdblTuF2mpJuoWY6\nbbi8EHk/HTzVuNdk5M0g\n=hKKG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T01:54:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDdjNTVhYWY2ZDA5YTM0MWJjMjdkMzcwOTVkZDg5YTg1NDUwYzljM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608","sha":"7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608"}],"sha":"7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7c55aaf6d09a341bc27d37095dd89a85450c9c3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:18:42Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:18:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(order): administrators manage delivery and the carrier (#205)\n\nDelivery options, their prices and the one carrier move from appsettings into Order''s database, and administrators edit them at /admin/delivery (specs/098, closes #196).\n\n- delivery_options, delivery_option_prices and carriers tables; DeliverySeed inserts codes missing from configuration and never overwrites an edit\n- GET/PUT /api/orders/delivery... (Admin) and a public GET /api/orders/delivery/carrier; checkout and the quote read the stored options\n- the storefront links a tracking reference to the carrier''s tracking page when a template is set\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"118680877facabf771951db0ab91cfed1d84c845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/118680877facabf771951db0ab91cfed1d84c845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608","verification":{"payload":"tree 118680877facabf771951db0ab91cfed1d84c845\nparent e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790471922 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790471922 +0700\n\nfeat(order): administrators manage delivery and the carrier (#205)\n\nDelivery options, their prices and the one carrier move from appsettings into Order''s database, and administrators edit them at /admin/delivery (specs/098, closes #196).\n\n- delivery_options, delivery_option_prices and carriers tables; DeliverySeed inserts codes missing from configuration and never overwrites an edit\n- GET/PUT /api/orders/delivery... (Admin) and a public GET /api/orders/delivery/carrier; checkout and the quote read the stored options\n- the storefront links a tracking reference to the carrier''s tracking page when a template is set\n- Bruno, docs, reference regenerated, full spec record\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquG7yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOpoQAAOFfBBO5/ILjqkVGSjrX85R\nRqseQPvTmhgJG6kCrZdkNu88EVNiBW2+z9fVDRrsmRPZn+PrHbnyQYhhov0VjMqR\nITVvO6O7bjarL/bF8JtIBWNocNK1yLMq0nrCCHsTZZN/XgUvSoCIyOFrIAZwMp0+\nrPlUhwHADN26ccsP8VGVH25jPA4v/bm8836hbylHqXZH1fWNS93IpMan2F9NYXL4\nEoRMeqN7Wk0JUrPRIK/eHzso7KtDkCjDoI0UMJXTZosw/SXzs/8ecdw2iNx818qJ\nH9CzPu0toDizhqShCxDqEqhDHGfouLlAFZQPXRWooyA4mhCS+Asfk3SZCQOL6O1i\nDqhvPfSQDjOVJ6qP6bdvqT273jrKvGhQ1TD6MLtc4xDC6miBnViR0N5+lQXkCOby\nenJtjL1xxeeS1bwYb+WvXw3JsX11FJxfCvkUyPdbXL01lo7jReipWDBXzj8RTINa\nlXEZPSP9affcPCnV7+VpMZQYKeNaTQvmhOw0YX/VAJpXvxeasiay7F/nA8sACskv\now5Zl4yBssqxpnCn/m/uw7wlKPbeIzFQBfrlkNxrHjwZtggyNjBEZD3ofg+gsMq7\n18wowUbmSKax9LyCrIkc6kPEnOPD9Tu/79xbXzK2hK9TnGyNxDC00dOSB5+BvW0t\noLnph5zsqK4/oYm9I1Vm\n=w3nN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T01:18:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKDczMzQwMThjM2QzNDk3ZjE5M2EzZDExM2E5MzhiYmEwNDlkNDU2MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377","sha":"e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377"}],"sha":"7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/7334018c3d3497f193a3d113a938bba049d45608"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:00:22Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:00:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): administrators manage categories (#204)\n\nCategories could be created, deleted and translated only through the API, and a category''s own\nname could not be changed at all (#195).\n\nPUT /api/categories/{id} (Admin) renames the default-language text and description, audited;\nthe slug never changes. /admin/categories lists every category with its Vietnamese and English\nnames, creates one at an address suggested from its name, edits both languages (English through\nspecs/026''s translation endpoints; cleared, it is removed) and deletes with a confirmation,\nshowing the server''s 409 in its words.\n\nFound while building: a duplicate slug was a 500 (a bare Exception the shared handler cannot\nmap) - now a 409 with words; categories.IsActive is dead data (every row false, nothing reads\nit) - recorded, left alone.\n\nTests: CategoryAdminTests (4, the 409 red before), 7 page tests; Catalog 230/230, storefront\n484/484; three mutations caught; Bruno 286/286.\n\nCloses #195\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bdcda46c4f21e47a3e32492459bbd16f15e6a21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/9bdcda46c4f21e47a3e32492459bbd16f15e6a21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377","verification":{"payload":"tree 9bdcda46c4f21e47a3e32492459bbd16f15e6a21\nparent 6f42a94682686fda729fcd894a0bb708104d0310\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790470822 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790470822 +0700\n\nfeat(catalog): administrators manage categories (#204)\n\nCategories could be created, deleted and translated only through the API, and a category''s own\nname could not be changed at all (#195).\n\nPUT /api/categories/{id} (Admin) renames the default-language text and description, audited;\nthe slug never changes. /admin/categories lists every category with its Vietnamese and English\nnames, creates one at an address suggested from its name, edits both languages (English through\nspecs/026''s translation endpoints; cleared, it is removed) and deletes with a confirmation,\nshowing the server''s 409 in its words.\n\nFound while building: a duplicate slug was a 500 (a bare Exception the shared handler cannot\nmap) - now a 409 with words; categories.IsActive is dead data (every row false, nothing reads\nit) - recorded, left alone.\n\nTests: CategoryAdminTests (4, the 409 red before), 7 page tests; Catalog 230/230, storefront\n484/484; three mutations caught; Bruno 286/286.\n\nCloses #195\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquGqmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbTgQADyCXDdSCH0WLTRv5rEPB74B\nU5fnoBQ7BgHaIcOAw88m534gubbNnLu+/e/cSWDY1EcqOZiNz9OexJNMPwBsfRcO\ngwNLZ4A5I/bElfdd2v6jAGmgvl+LsyDztiBstXQj72X2X4GhKFlwWEDOlo9Y/tVt\ntrGH1zGKh3fEiVC2aaIS6z1P+KNpBlx8d9xU6D+XWuIwZ2w+g3V3Rz8GH2xVH9ac\n4n+DY5Rh3BT/My2WXT5NAx5Yi0W9USjUgizri4BHjAXgevwOClQyF07LJ3TEdn0w\n4U9+15X+f4WifKO6LF1T1C5jLnb4M/SWEzDYIRxRDDxsvR1EzabtsbRW9nKJOIsv\nIeMn+j4Oqr4iRM4QBI5jJKMGid0o0S5r/siXwxBztimZ6zvCp10mNzZNB0DRnK4C\nkjQvZ2Pwpq1rWAwRfX7bEhvostylZ62vSdMEX9FI6xB3mQYFVLXU7wVw2b7CDf5b\n8NquRLbfC5M428gOxnyo8SRaMKiP8xkFR3jWvba2fKyUxnriXTBQs3tUkdm1IK68\noNTJFzNtFw7KoJTIfZ+ofsLIZQpCxTDU6JQ8bXj+P0lIBz49AdH4adK3NlBNy32U\neiWdljHM6xF0NOsLwQ2y1Djztc/RNrNvkfszlksd46miGLUVFD7ZEjOSv4YT6M9M\nyph+B+UxowIredynoPXC\n=uRXk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T01:00:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377","node_id":"C_kwDOUJVo4NoAKGU1NjI0MGE3OTYzMTM3ZDRmODI0MTAwOGYxMTU1NTJlMGNiMWQzNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commit/6f42a94682686fda729fcd894a0bb708104d0310","sha":"6f42a94682686fda729fcd894a0bb708104d0310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/6f42a94682686fda729fcd894a0bb708104d0310"}],"sha":"e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/e56240a7963137d4f8241008f115552e0cb1d377"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/6f42a94682686fda729fcd894a0bb708104d0310/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T00:45:04Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T00:45:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(order): staff find any order (#203)\n\nThe console listed orders only as the fulfilment queue - paid ones, by the shop''s parcel - so a\nfailed, cancelled or still-settling order could not be found at all (#194).\n\nGET /api/orders/staff (Admin) lists any order newest first, filtered by an order-id prefix\n(4-36 hex, case-insensitive), a customer id and a status (Paid includes the legacy Completed),\nwith the customer''s id on each row. /admin/orders/find takes an id prefix or an email - the\nstorefront turns an email into a person through Identity''s staff search, so Order never learns\nemails - with status tabs, names from Identity''s lookup, and a link to the staff order view.\n\nDecided on the user''s behalf: the storefront composes the email search; administrators only,\nlike the other owner-unscoped order read (specs/096 research D1, D2).\n\nTests: 8 Order tests, 4 page tests; three mutations caught; storefront 477/477; Bruno 283/283\n(the collection''s order found by its first 8 characters, a customer''s token 403).\n\nCloses #194\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b50cfee6e620ba9b3731cc90a8412ddc3a6a8f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/1b50cfee6e620ba9b3731cc90a8412ddc3a6a8f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/6f42a94682686fda729fcd894a0bb708104d0310","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b50cfee6e620ba9b3731cc90a8412ddc3a6a8f2\nparent 5ca38919469a1c07b40bec4960a8fa147367d82a\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790469904 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790469904 +0700\n\nfeat(order): staff find any order (#203)\n\nThe console listed orders only as the fulfilment queue - paid ones, by the shop''s parcel - so a\nfailed, cancelled or still-settling order could not be found at all (#194).\n\nGET /api/orders/staff (Admin) lists any order newest first, filtered by an order-id prefix\n(4-36 hex, case-insensitive), a customer id and a status (Paid includes the legacy Completed),\nwith the customer''s id on each row. /admin/orders/find takes an id prefix or an email - the\nstorefront turns an email into a person through Identity''s staff search, so Order never learns\nemails - with status tabs, names from Identity''s lookup, and a link to the staff order view.\n\nDecided on the user''s behalf: the storefront composes the email search; administrators only,\nlike the other owner-unscoped order read (specs/096 research D1, D2).\n\nTests: 8 Order tests, 4 page tests; three mutations caught; storefront 477/477; Bruno 283/283\n(the collection''s order found by its first 8 characters, a customer''s token 403).\n\nCloses #194\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquGcQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeL8QAHCsQaykeocH8z3vvvFbh6bg\nvv7rSTn9ZRD/qaqIYQNvECa0gonOYwPkfDRmOFgEQnkbn60B/8BqIjnqOzvoGeVL\nzn5E