35a49744a3a6f446e","sha":"0026aa737e2288061c744b535a49744a3a6f446e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/0026aa737e2288061c744b535a49744a3a6f446e"}],"sha":"ad095c048e3b323adfdf66115665c6189846b007","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/ad095c048e3b323adfdf66115665c6189846b007"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139071865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiicamaru","id":139071865,"login":"jessiicamaru","node_id":"U_kgDOCEoReQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessiicamaru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/commits/0026aa737e2288061c744b535a49744a3a6f446e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T21:09:57Z","email":"139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dũng Hoàng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T21:09:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(catalog): a product inserted without a review status waits for review (#192)\n\nproducts.ReviewStatus defaulted to ''Approved'' in the database. After the specs/045 backfill\nthe default decides only an INSERT that omits the column - an image from before specs/045\nrunning after a rollback - and it put that image''s seller products on sale unreviewed (#184).\n\nOne migration sets the default to ''Pending'' by SQL; Down restores ''Approved''. No row is\nrewritten and the model snapshot is unchanged. The default is deliberately not HasDefaultValue\nin the model: the enum''s CLR default is Approved, and EF would then omit it from every INSERT\nand file the shop''s own products as Pending - a comment on the mapping and a test hold that.\n\nDecided on the user''s behalf: change the default rather than document the risk (specs/093\nresearch D1).\n\nTests: an old-image insert by SQL is stored Pending (red before); the shop''s own product is\nstored Approved; Catalog 217/217; two mutations caught; Bruno 276/276 with the migration applied.\n\nCloses #184\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22217728f9dae89db78ab2797db79c5a0a88d88e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/trees/22217728f9dae89db78ab2797db79c5a0a88d88e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jessiicamaru/e-commerce-asp-dotnet-practice/git/commits/0026aa737e2288061c744b535a49744a3a6f446e","verification":{"payload":"tree 22217728f9dae89db78ab2797db79c5a0a88d88e\nparent 812767a539ccc78b858ae94adc2697280e8c7302\nauthor Dũng Hoàng <139071865+jessiicamaru@users.noreply.github.com> 1790456997 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790456997 +0700\n\nfix(catalog): a product inserted without a review status waits for review (#192)\n\nproducts.ReviewStatus defaulted to ''Approved'' in the database. After the specs/045 backfill\nthe default decides only an INSERT that omits the column - an image from before specs/045\nrunning after a rollback - and it put that image''s seller products on sale unreviewed (#184).\n\nOne migration sets the default to ''Pending'' by SQL; Down restores ''Approved''. No row is\nrewritten and the model snapshot is unchanged. The default is deliberately not HasDefaultValue\nin the model: the enum''s CLR default is Approved, and EF would then omit it from every INSERT\nand file the shop''s own products as Pending - a comment on the mapping and a test hold that.\n\nDecided on the user''s behalf: change the default rather than document the risk (specs/093\nresearch D1).\n\nTests: an old-image insert by SQL is stored Pending (red before); the shop''s own product is\nstored Approved; Catalog 217/217; two mutations caught; Bruno 276/276 with the migration applied.\n\nCloses #184\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquDSlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbnEQAKKznxRxXX0hpGMTYRCCWrbJ\nn9S4jlRLS73IS1o8NbBtZCKo2tw8pDkoZSqTgmdJCeN736bE/gaRE/5zfRaMlm/Y\nyCruGkEKcpz5wuPOgWJ8Q/DaEeiN9eK9CZXhbiuwsYtGodD9rdZmhOZiKQaEDEz7\n7+w69/xiasKy5PyNeLfxhZTAAxzmA71Sh6JJ3cNEnWNAaY3fl04XNkNcSREZXIZs\nyIFfLJjO6mjkw2/qVeuEkEadhhLt0MStp6UGEaRznnxPjcRanrHnRWnpo4EP5WmX\nNDm9EQTqkytU1ZoB7mP/Sft99S8tZpPxGbrhhv31OAkPUu5XWE8HTO3mrPXIZiqL\n8Y7nhd0eGeBzFdUxkV/YQsD8h7SQo/N3kP2VkH+Q3O6gCr+kF/W5pbv147y8RTgu\n4mrDGs19KuC7ZvyrZMsJZEwA4Foh9xwBY/tPSwl6CBts7dUEPmclXRSDmup40pMK\nSlV14TIPS++MEUEa8WF5FnZb+5hrK/x39vqpOnz/KbD756EpfGrU/P26QbgG6l0W\nrcM00pApbTiLELowRuO4DYMO4YQkMMAeixURE+lmNa/fUQprV7DPElY/+WrqLPP0\niTMBbb2N3HNX84yFifv/MCYEOmfr1TFhmAZ1IZch/0EMhGyD8xRbPWOGcjxAm/SQ\n1Y9j8l2ur8B7tcbka3FT\n=Y4SD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T21:09:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","org