4022278","sha":"a3b85812164f22ebcf860da6ef5197aaa4022278","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/a3b85812164f22ebcf860da6ef5197aaa4022278"}],"sha":"de3e597108c04a2cb929ca03b85f5ff9306fbf27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/de3e597108c04a2cb929ca03b85f5ff9306fbf27"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/a3b85812164f22ebcf860da6ef5197aaa4022278/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:49:59Z","email":"opencode@local.dev","name":"Vadim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:49:59Z","email":"opencode@local.dev","name":"Vadim"},"message":"feat(batch2): Split-View Code Editor, Storybook UI Kit, Drag-and-Drop reorder, Design Blocks library, Vision Import (#61, #62, #63, #64, #65)\n\n- Add Split-View Code Editor drawer (Issue #61): collapsible right panel with\n  live code editing, debounced hot-reload sync via /api/preview, and file path\n  display. Bi-directional: changes in editor update canvas, session switch\n  updates editor content.\n\n- Add Storybook UI Kit Explorer (Issue #62): lib/storybook.js scans workspace\n  for .jsx/.tsx/.vue components, builds variant matrix. Tool 15\n  live_canvas_storybook registered. UI Kit button in toolbar.\n\n- Add Drag-and-Drop visual section reordering (Issue #63): sandbox.js injects\n  drag-start/over/drop/end handlers on section/header/footer/nav elements.\n  Reordered HTML posted to POST /api/save-reorder endpoint. Toggle button in\n  toolbar with active state styling.\n\n- Add Curated Design Blocks library (Issue #64): lib/templates.js provides 5\n  high-end blocks (Hero Mesh Glow, Bento Grid Features, Pricing Tiers, FAQ\n  Accordion, Agency Footer). Tool 16 live_canvas_insert_block registered.\n  GET /api/templates endpoint. Modal catalog in client UI.\n\n- Add Screenshot/Image to Code converter (Issue #65): Tool 17\n  live_canvas_vision_import registered, accepts imageUrl/imagePath/generatedCode\n  and creates Live Canvas session.\n\n- All 54 tests pass (including 3 new batch2_studio tests).\n- Version bumped to 0.1.27.","tree":{"sha":"44c2c391d571e011feed4dc57e2a841de4b9f77f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/44c2c391d571e011feed4dc57e2a841de4b9f77f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/a3b85812164f22ebcf860da6ef5197aaa4022278","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/a3b85812164f22ebcf860da6ef5197aaa4022278","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKGEzYjg1ODEyMTY0ZjIyZWJjZjg2MGRhNmVmNTE5N2FhYTQwMjIyNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/cb00d86ad800dec02b3e1ced2777e5f53b4dc0d8","sha":"cb00d86ad800dec02b3e1ced2777e5f53b4dc0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cb00d86ad800dec02b3e1ced2777e5f53b4dc0d8"}],"sha":"a3b85812164f22ebcf860da6ef5197aaa4022278","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/a3b85812164f22ebcf860da6ef5197aaa4022278"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cb00d86ad800dec02b3e1ced2777e5f53b4dc0d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:39:25Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:39:25Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"fix(schema): resolve JsonSchemaError with explicit additionalProperties on tool schemas (#67)","tree":{"sha":"0eb5536af48f933cfafc37be52e35df653d18521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/0eb5536af48f933cfafc37be52e35df653d18521"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/cb00d86ad800dec02b3e1ced2777e5f53b4dc0d8","veri