-canvas/commit/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233","sha":"c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5","sha":"122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5"}],"sha":"14716a11c783b1ad0404b34ad85d8fd67e5bc303","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/14716a11c783b1ad0404b34ad85d8fd67e5bc303"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:19:48Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:19:48Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"feat(coeditor): smart multi-file bundler, asset server, wysiwyg co-editor, style tweaker, and ai prompt (#56, #57, #58, #59, #60)\n\nРелиз v0.1.24 (Пакет 1):\n1. [Issue #56] Smart Multi-File ESM Bundler: Рекурсивное склеивание локальных импортов (`./Header.jsx`, `./data.js`, `.css`) для проектов Vite/React.\n2. [Issue #57] Static Asset & Image Server: Маршрутизация локальных картинок (`.png`, `.svg`, `.jpg`) и стилей через `/dsh-live-canvas/assets/*`.\n3. [Issue #58] Inline WYSIWYG Text Co-Editor: Двойной клик на текст на холсте включает `contentEditable` с сохранением изменений в файл на диске через `POST /api/save-content`.\n4. [Issue #59] Floating Visual Tailwind Style Tweaker: Всплывающая панель настройки цветов, отступов (`p-*`, `m-*`), скруглений и теней.\n5. [Issue #60] In-Place AI Prompt on Selected Element: Микро-промпт агенту по выделенному элементу с регистрацией инструмента `live_canvas_refine_element`.\n6. Все 51/51 тест пройдены успешно (PASS).","tree":{"sha":"6e3320728a7527096a0fb8f8e8715b664cacb539","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/6e3320728a7527096a0fb8f8e8715b664cacb539"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKDEyMjM4MmRmZDdmMGRhMWFlNGMwNTFmOGYwM2MyMWZhZDJmODNhYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233","sha":"c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233"}],"sha":"122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/122382dfd7f0da1ae4c051f8f03c21fad2f83ab5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:45:04Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.local","name":"Antigravity IDE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:45:04Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.local","name":"Antigravity IDE"},"message":"fix(init): auto-open first workspace file, fix demo template clicks, and fix select onChange (#55)\n\nMerged fix for 0.1.23 after 49/49 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"de176612807d0d108f2f358607770db4b32b095a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/de176612807d0d108f2f358607770db4b32b095a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKGM0Y2E2ZDQ2OTQ2MDY2ZWU0NjlkYjZjZTMyMGY4NmQzOWZjZWUyMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f","sha":"0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005","sha":"cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005"}],"sha":"c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/c4ca6d46946066ee469db6ce320f86d39fcee233"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:44:58Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:44:58Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"fix(init): auto-open first workspace file, fix demo template clicks, and fix select onChange (#54)\n\nСимптом:\n1. При открытии Live Canvas отображался экран-заглушка \"Холст готов к работе\", несмотря на наличие файлов в проекте.\n2. При клике на первый файл в выпадающем списке событие onChange не срабатывало из-за отсутствия значения по умолчанию.\n3. Клик по кнопкам \"React Калькулятор\" и \"SaaS Дашборд\" внутри экрана-заглушки не передавал canvasId в родительский компонент.\n\nРешение:\n1. В `lib/client.js` автоматически открывать первый найденный файл рабочей области (например, `coffee-shop-landing/preview.html`), если в памяти еще нет активных сессий.\n2. Добавить скрытый дефолтный пункт выбора в `<select>`, гарантируя срабатывание `onChange` при выборе любого файла.\n3. В `lib/index.js` в `welcomeHtml` отправлять `postMessage({ type: ''dlc_session_created'', canvasId })` в родительское окно при создании демо-сессии.\n4. Версия поднята до 0.1.23.","tree":{"sha":"de176612807d0d108f2f358607770db4b32b095a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/de176612807d0d108f2f358607770db4b32b095a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKGNmMDZhZjgwOTBlZjg0MDdjYzY2OTBiZjJkNTU0MmYyM2Y1MzgwMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f","sha":"0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f"}],"sha":"cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cf06af8090ef8407cc6690bf2d5542f23f538005"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:16Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.local","name":"Antigravity IDE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:16Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.local","name":"Antigravity IDE"},"message":"fix(switcher): iframe key reactivity, dropdown selection sync, and prevent SSE override (#53)\n\nMerged fix for 0.1.22 after 49/49 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"c86fa60056c1f3989997ec51f01ee095ed6b0597","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/c86fa60056c1f3989997ec51f01ee095ed6b0597"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKDBhNzU5YmJhNDFlYzcyMTc4OWJiZDYwMTEwY2I5ZWNjMDM3MDRkNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/c3915668fbedd45cb245d24db02da68ce478831e","sha":"c3915668fbedd45cb245d24db02da68ce478831e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/c3915668fbedd45cb245d24db02da68ce478831e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc","sha":"4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc"}],"sha":"0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/0a759bba41ec721789bbd60110cb9ecc03704d6f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:11Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:11Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"fix(switcher): iframe key reactivity, dropdown selection sync, and prevent SSE override (#52)\n\nСимптом:\nПри выборе файла из выпадающего списка (например, coffee-shop-landing/preview.html) холст не переключался и оставался открытым ранее выбранный объект.\n\nРешение:\n1. В `lib/client.js` добавлен `key={activeId}` на все iframe (основной и матрицу), что гарантирует мгновенную перезагрузку и отрисовку выбранного холста.\n2. Подключен `canvasIdRef` для предотвращения перетирания выбранного пользователем холста при фоновых событиях SSE от других сессий.\n3. Добавлено точное сопоставление `selectedDropdownValue` со значением `ws_path_ + session.filePath`.\n4. Версия поднята до 0.1.22.","tree":{"sha":"c86fa60056c1f3989997ec51f01ee095ed6b0597","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/c86fa60056c1f3989997ec51f01ee095ed6b0597"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKDRlNTc1ZTliNzJjYTE5NTE5ZGFmNDE3YTBjMzk5YTU1ZjkwZDkxYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/c3915668fbedd45cb245d24db02da68ce478831e","sha":"c3915668fbedd45cb245d24db02da68ce478831e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/c3915668fbedd45cb245d24db02da68ce478831e"}],"sha":"4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/4e575e9b72ca19519daf417a0c399a55f90d91bc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/c3915668fbedd45cb245d24db02da68ce478831e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:30:15Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.local","name":"Antigravity IDE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:30:15Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.local","name":"Antigravity IDE"},"message":"fix(viewport): persistent DOM frame caching across viewport mode switches (#51)\n\nMerged fix for 0.1.21 after 49/49 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"b8990ce3a12dba55f75874f58