33.215Z","repositoryId":1352220414,"sha":"d2045a4ea102e6a342b4a6d628e23a2f03d85521"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:27:33.215Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/49253b40313541e546700a909802c0465f98d98c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T12:43:06Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T12:43:06Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"fix(client): remove obsolete @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime injection for DSH alpha2 compatibility (#36)\n\nСимптом:\nВ DSH 0.1.2-alpha.2 клиентский файбер плагина зависает в неактивном состоянии с ошибкой `AggregateError: loader fibers failed`.\n\nПричина:\nВ секции `dsh.client.inject` манифеста `package.json` был объявлен устаревший модуль `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime`, который отсутствует в поставке DSH 0.1.2-alpha.2.\n\nРешение:\n1. Удален `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime` из `dsh.client.inject` в `package.json`.\n2. Добавлен тест `test/alpha2_boot.test.mjs` на проверку отсутствия устаревших runtime-модулей и корректную инициализацию клиентской части на alpha2 (44/44 PASS).\n3. Версия поднята до 0.1.15.","tree":{"sha":"ab1b636abc5b36da8e6ffb0a724c55cb51adf616","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/ab1b636abc5b36da8e6ffb0a724c55cb51adf616"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/49253b40313541e546700a909802c0465f98d98c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/49253b40313541e546700a909802c0465f98d98c","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKDQ5MjUzYjQwMzEzNTQxZTU0NjcwMGE5MDk4MDJjMDQ2NWY5OGQ5OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/94115e120610e3b620503456286c8d87cdcc0fab","sha":"94115e120610e3b6