/api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/3207f0009cd275164ae2907770ab6658733576f3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/b859ab7e2f1f37e3c69ea7a000597afc5fab1941/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:09:22Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:09:22Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"feat(sidebar): add native dsh-better-sidebar Tab & FileViewer integration (#32)\n\nЦель:\nБесшовная интеграция Live Canvas с плагином dsh-better-sidebar:\n- Регистрация вкладки «🎨 Live Canvas» через `ctx.betterSidebar.registerTab`.\n- Регистрация специализированного FileViewer (`registerFileViewer`) для файлов `.html`, `.jsx`, `.tsx`, `.svg`, `.mermaid`, `.mmd`.\n- Перехват URL (`urlTarget`) для отображения страниц предпросмотра прямо в правой боковой панели.\n- Компонент `LiveCanvasFileViewer` для предпросмотра файлов при клике в дереве проводника сайдбара.\n- test/: модульные тесты интеграции (42/42 PASS).\n- package.json: версия 0.1.13.","tree":{"sha":"e29f5bbe1483d32206c56311ee0e8b455afce16f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/e29f5bbe1483d32206c56311ee0e8b455afce16f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/b859ab7e2f1f37e3c69ea7a000597afc5fab1941","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/b859ab7e2f1f37e3c69ea7a000597afc5fab1941","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKGI4NTlhYjdlMmYxZjM3ZTNjNjllYTdhMDAwNTk3YWZjNWZhYjE5NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/341d2366f66a9bf55993ecd48f75ea26192e6961","sha":"341d2366f66a9bf55993ecd48f75ea26192e6961","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/341d23