avity IDE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:34:42Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.local","name":"Antigravity IDE"},"message":"feat(packager): add 1-Click Vite Project ZIP Packager and live_canvas_pack tool (#31)\n\nMerged feature 0.1.12 after 40/40 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"ec07e6c25281515c7baa8013af8a2902969787bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/ec07e6c25281515c7baa8013af8a2902969787bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/bd718206a59945d1d7eafe552471f8689863deb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/bd718206a59945d1d7eafe552471f8689863deb6","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKGJkNzE4MjA2YTU5OTQ1ZDFkN2VhZmU1NTI0NzFmODY4OTg2M2RlYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/95732f0eb9e76844adc151283c195a8495ccce8b","sha":"95732f0eb9e76844adc151283c195a8495ccce8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/95732f0eb9e76844adc151283c195a8495ccce8b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223","sha":"cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223"}],"sha":"bd718206a59945d1d7eafe552471f8689863deb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/bd718206a59945d1d7eafe552471f8689863deb6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:34:38Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:34:38Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"feat(packager): add 1-Click Vite Project ZIP Packager and live_canvas_pack tool (#30)\n\nЦель:\nОбеспечить экспорт любого компонента предпросмотра в виде готового автономного Vite + React / Vue / Tailwind проекта в ZIP-архив в 1 клик или прямо в директорию воркспейса.\n\nЧто сделано:\n- lib/packager.js: модуль генерации структуры файлов проекта и бинарный ZIP-энкодер без внешних зависимостей (zlib deflate).\n- lib/index.js: REST эндпоинт `/dsh-live-canvas/api/pack/:canvasId` (application/zip).\n- lib/tools.js: агентский инструмент `live_canvas_pack` (13-й инструмент).\n- lib/client.js: кнопка «📦 Pack» в тулбаре LiveCanvasWorkspace для мгновенного скачивания ZIP в браузере.\n- test/: тесты упаковщика и 13 инструментов (40/40 PASS).\n- package.json: версия 0.1.12.","tree":{"sha":"ec07e6c25281515c7baa8013af8a2902969787bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/ec07e6c25281515c7baa8013af8a2902969787bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/commits/cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKGNkMDNkZThjODIzM2QyNWM1ZTMzODZiMzNmOTcwZDE5Yzk2NzYyMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/95732f0eb9e76844adc151283c195a8495ccce8b","sha":"95732f0eb9e76844adc151283c195a8495ccce8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/95732f0eb9e76844adc151283c195a8495ccce8b"}],"sha":"cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/cd03de8c8233d25c5e3386b33f970d19c9676223"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/95732f0eb9e76844adc151283c195a8495ccce8b/comments","com