ooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/6a18bf45e8923b86dd7ee9a0906643cbaa41670c","node_id":"C_kwDOUJk-_toAKDZhMThiZjQ1ZTg5MjNiODZkZDdlZTlhMDkwNjY0M2NiYWE0MTY3MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/14b86186e4fe60f2a3d07bfad9808c7551d6279a","sha":"14b86186e4fe60f2a3d07bfad9808c7551d6279a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/14b86186e4fe60f2a3d07bfad9808c7551d6279a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commit/bee55f384e1aab6654545d4c99df261fd60bb842","sha":"bee55f384e1aab6654545d4c99df261fd60bb842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/bee55f384e1aab6654545d4c99df261fd60bb842"}],"sha":"6a18bf45e8923b86dd7ee9a0906643cbaa41670c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/6a18bf45e8923b86dd7ee9a0906643cbaa41670c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/commits/bee55f384e1aab6654545d4c99df261fd60bb842/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T08:49:03Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T08:49:03Z","email":"antigravity@goodandready.app","name":"antigravity"},"message":"fix(tools): flatten parameters object map for DSH defineTool compatibility\n\nЦель:\nПриведение параметров инструментов к формату `{ paramName: { type, description } }`, ожидаемому компилятором JSON Schema в DSH defineTool.\n\nПричина:\nDSH defineTool ожидает плоский объект свойств, а не вложенный `{ type: \"object\", properties: { ... } }`.\n\nЧто сделано:\n- Исправлена структура parameters для live_canvas_preview, live_canvas_inspect, live_canvas_reload.\n\nПроверки:\n- npm test (18/18 тестов PASS).","tree":{"sha":"98033272c43d22477e15c148ccba60b1cc9208c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-live-canvas/git/trees/98033272c43d22477e15c148ccba60b1cc9208c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goo