:{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:26:42Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:26:42Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(portal): surface GitLab search/branch errors to the UI, guard against malformed API responses\n\nFinal whole-branch review findings fixed in one pass:\n- searchGitlabRepos/getGitlabBranches now return a discriminated\n  {ok, ...} result instead of silently swallowing 503s, mirroring\n  testGitlabConnection''s existing error-extraction pattern; the\n  administrar-repositorios component surfaces the backend detail in\n  the error banner / per-row branchesError instead of a generic\n  empty state.\n- runSearch now clears selectedIds on every new search to avoid a\n  stale-selection bug when a previously selected repo reappears in a\n  later search.\n- toggleSelected forces the checkbox''s DOM checked property back to\n  false on a branch-load failure, since Angular''s [checked] binding\n  only rewrites the DOM when the bound expression''s value changes\n  across change detection cycles (it stayed false both before and\n  after the failed click), which otherwise left the native\n  browser-toggled checkbox visually checked.\n- routes_gitlab.py: guard project[\"path_with_namespace\"] and\n  branch[\"name\"] dict subscripts with .get() so a GitLab response\n  missing a field 503s via the existing error path instead of a bare\n  500.\n- conftest.py: fix admin_client fixture''s return type to\n  Iterator[TestClient] to match its generator implementation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012knjjG5qUhhdFAgM8qNDDG","tree":{"sha":"984f875ce5be0b403ca5447441771c0a24355fa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kb-comsatel/git/trees/984f875ce5be0b403ca5447441771c0a24355fa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kb-comsatel/git/commits/8f184c7ca4b1f92fe87d9756e3d2f1295cc544a1","